const navItems=[['Overview','◫'],['Assets','▣'],['Findings','⚑'],['Events','◷'],['Correlations','⌘'],['Investigations','◎'],['Remediation','↗'],['Audit Trail','≋'],['Settings','⚙'],['About','ⓘ']];
const collections=['assets','findings','events','correlations','investigations','remediations','audit','settings'];
const state={page:'Overview',data:{},query:'',selected:null,correlationFilter:'All',entityFilter:'',remediationFilter:'',demo:null,graphScale:1,sidebarCollapsed:false,loading:false,loaded:false,lastRenderedPage:null,liveDemo:null,demoConfig:null,demoAdmin:null,demoLogin:null,accessSession:null,accessRequests:[],accessSecurityEvents:[],accessQr:null,accessPortalActive:false,accessMessage:'',sorts:{events:{key:'time',direction:'desc'}}};
const DISCLAIMER="CyberRakshak provides security analysis and remediation guidance based on the information available. Its findings and proposed actions may be incomplete or inaccurate, and successful remediation is not guaranteed.\n\nActions may affect system availability, data, or network operations. Review and approve changes before execution. For confirmed or potentially serious incidents, consult a qualified cybersecurity professional.\n\nA 'verified' relationship means the available evidence supports a connection; it does not necessarily mean a system has been compromised.";
const $=s=>document.querySelector(s), esc=s=>String(s??'').replace(/[&<>"']/g,c=>({'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','"':'&quot;',"'":'&#39;'}[c]));
const id=prefix=>prefix+'-'+Math.random().toString(36).slice(2,7).toUpperCase(), now=()=>new Date().toLocaleString('en-IN', { timeZone: 'Asia/Kolkata' });
const API_BASE=new URLSearchParams(location.search).get('api')==='local'?'':(document.querySelector('meta[name="api-base-url"]')?.content||'').replace(/\/$/,'');
async function api(path,opts={}){const headers={'Content-Type':'application/json','X-CSRF-Token':state.accessSession?.csrfToken||state.demoAdmin?.csrfToken||sessionStorage.getItem('cr-workspace-csrf')||sessionStorage.getItem('cr-live-demo-csrf')||'',...(opts.headers||{})};let r=await fetch(`${API_BASE}/api/${path}`,{credentials:'include',...opts,headers});let data=await r.json().catch(()=>({error:'Invalid server response'}));if(!r.ok)throw Error(data.error||`Request failed (${r.status})`);return data}
async function refresh(){
  state.loading=true;render();
  try{let res=await Promise.all(collections.map(k=>api(k)));collections.forEach((k,i)=>state.data[k]=res[i]);state.error='';state.loaded=true}
  catch(e){state.error=e.message}
  finally{state.loading=false;render()}
  if(!state.error&&!localStorage.getItem('cr-onboarded'))showOnboarding()
}
function save(kind,obj){return api(kind,{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify(obj)}).then(refresh)}
function status(s){let c=String(s).toLowerCase();if(c==='high'||c==='critical'||c==='open')c=c==='open'?'medium':c;return `<span class="badge ${esc(c)}">${esc(s)}</span>`}
function shell(){
  let isOpen=state.menu?'open':'',collapsed=state.sidebarCollapsed?'is-collapsed':'';
  return `<div class="shell ${collapsed}"><aside class="sidebar ${isOpen}" id="primary-nav"><div class="brand"><div class="logo" aria-hidden="true">C</div><div class="brand-copy"><b>CyberRakshak AI</b><small>Security workspace</small></div><button class="icon-button sidebar-collapse" onclick="toggleSidebar()" aria-label="${state.sidebarCollapsed?'Expand':'Collapse'} sidebar" aria-pressed="${state.sidebarCollapsed}"><span aria-hidden="true">${state.sidebarCollapsed?'»':'«'}</span></button></div><button class="workspace" onclick="navigate('Overview')" title="${esc(state.data.settings?.[0]?.name||'Northstar Dental Clinic')}"><span class="workspace-mark" aria-hidden="true">⌂</span><span class="workspace-copy"><small>WORKSPACE</small><strong>${esc(state.data.settings?.[0]?.name||'Northstar Dental Clinic')}</strong></span><span class="workspace-chevron" aria-hidden="true">⌄</span></button><div class="nav-label">Workspace</div><nav class="nav" aria-label="Workspace navigation">${navItems.map(([n,icon])=>`<button class="${state.page===n?'active':''}" ${state.page===n?'aria-current="page"':''} onclick="navigate('${n}')" title="${n}"><span class="nav-icon" aria-hidden="true">${icon}</span><span class="nav-text">${n}</span></button>`).join('')}</nav><div class="side-bottom"><span class="sim-dot"></span><span class="side-copy"><b>Simulation mode</b><small>Fictional evidence only</small></span></div></aside>${state.menu?'<button class="nav-scrim" onclick="toggleMenu()" aria-label="Close navigation"></button>':''}<main class="main"><header class="topbar"><div class="topbar-left"><button class="icon-button mobile-menu" onclick="toggleMenu()" aria-label="Open navigation" aria-expanded="${!!state.menu}" aria-controls="primary-nav">☰</button><div class="top-context"><span class="top-context-label">SECURITY WORKSPACE</span><b>${esc(state.page==='Overview'?'Command center':state.page)}</b></div><label class="search-wrap"><span aria-hidden="true">⌕</span><input class="search" placeholder="Search assets, findings, events…" value="${esc(state.query)}" oninput="globalSearch(this.value)" aria-label="Search workspace"><kbd>⌘ K</kbd></label></div><div class="topright">${state.accessSession?.role==='owner'&&state.accessSecurityEvents?.length?`<button class="security-notification" onclick="navigate('Overview')" aria-label="${state.accessSecurityEvents.length} security alert${state.accessSecurityEvents.length===1?'':'s'}; open owner security notifications">⚠ ${state.accessSecurityEvents.length} security alert${state.accessSecurityEvents.length===1?'':'s'}</button>`:''}<button class="intro-replay" onclick="replayIntro()" aria-label="Replay CyberRakshak introduction">Replay intro</button><span class="status-pill"><i></i>SIMULATION</span><button class="icon-button health-action" onclick="checkHealth()" aria-label="Check API health" title="Check API health"><span aria-hidden="true">⌁</span></button>${state.accessSession?.role==='owner'?'<button class="access-signout" onclick="demoAdminLogout()">Sign out</button>':state.accessSession?.role==='asset-manager'?'<button class="access-signout" onclick="logoutWorkspaceAccess()">Sign out</button>':''}${state.loading&&state.loaded?'<span class="refresh-label">Refreshing…</span>':''}</div></header><div class="page">${state.error?`<div class="alert error-alert"><span class="alert-icon" aria-hidden="true">!</span><div><b>Workspace data could not be loaded</b><small>${esc(state.error)}</small></div><button class="btn small" onclick="refresh()">Retry</button></div>`:''}${state.demo?.waiting?`<div class="banner"><span class="sim-dot"></span><b>Guided demo paused at ${demoSteps[state.demo.step][0]}</b><button class="btn small primary" style="margin-left:auto" onclick="resumeDemo()">Return to walkthrough</button></div>`:''}${pageContent()}</div></main></div><div id="modal-root"></div>`
}
function head(title,desc,buttons=''){return `<div class="page-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">NORTHSTAR DENTAL CLINIC / ${esc(state.page.toUpperCase())}</div><h1>${title}</h1><p class="sub">${desc}</p></div><div class="actions">${buttons}</div></div>`}
const btn=(label,fn,kind='')=>`<button class="btn ${kind}" onclick="${fn}">${label}</button>`;
function basePageContent(){
  if(state.loading&&!state.loaded)return `<section class="skeleton-page" aria-label="Loading workspace data"><div class="skeleton-line wide"></div><div class="skeleton-line short"></div><div class="skeleton-grid">${[1,2,3,4].map(()=>'<div class="skeleton-card"></div>').join('')}</div><div class="skeleton-panel"></div></section>`;
  if(state.error&&!state.loaded)return head('Workspace unavailable','The API did not return workspace data. Retry after the server is available.');
  switch(state.page){case'Overview':return overview();case'Assets':return assetsPage();case'Findings':return findingsPage();case'Events':return eventsPage();case'Correlations':return correlationsPage();case'Investigations':return investigationsPage();case'Remediation':return remediationPage();case'Audit Trail':return auditPage();case'Settings':return settingsPage();default:return aboutPage()}
}
const byId=(kind,id)=>state.data[kind]?.find(x=>x.id===id), val=(v,f='—')=>esc(v||f);
function eventAnalytics(events){
  if(!events.length)return `<div class="chart-empty"><span class="empty-orbit">∅</span><b>No event data yet</b><span>Event charts will appear when the API returns records.</span></div>`;
  const severity=[['Critical','#D77878'],['High','#DFA07D'],['Medium','#D6C86E'],['Low','#78B8DD']];
  const counts=severity.map(([name,color])=>({name,color,count:events.filter(e=>String(e.severity||'').toLowerCase()===name.toLowerCase()).length}));
  let offset=0;const stops=counts.map(x=>{const start=offset;offset+=x.count/events.length*100;return `${x.color} ${start}% ${offset}%`}).join(',');
  const days=Object.entries(events.reduce((all,e)=>{const day=String(e.time||'').slice(0,10);if(/^\d{4}-\d{2}-\d{2}$/.test(day))all[day]=(all[day]||0)+1;return all},{})).sort(([a],[b])=>a.localeCompare(b)).slice(-7);
  const max=Math.max(1,...days.map(([,n])=>n));
  return `<div class="analytics-grid"><div class="severity-chart-wrap"><button class="severity-donut" style="--donut:conic-gradient(${stops})" onclick="navigate('Events')" aria-label="${events.length} events across severities"><span><b>${events.length}</b><small>events</small></span></button><div class="chart-legend">${counts.filter(x=>x.count).map(x=>`<button onclick="showEventSeverity('${x.name}')"><i style="--legend:${x.color}"></i><span>${x.name}</span><b>${x.count}</b></button>`).join('')}</div></div><div class="activity-chart"><div class="chart-caption"><span>Events by recorded date</span><span class="chart-unit">${days.length?`${days.length} date${days.length===1?'':'s'}`:'No dated records'}</span></div>${days.length?`<div class="bar-chart" role="img" aria-label="Event counts grouped by dates recorded in the API"><div class="bar-guides"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>${days.map(([day,count])=>`<button class="bar-column" onclick="showEventDate('${day}')" title="${count} event${count===1?'':'s'} on ${day}"><span class="bar-value">${count}</span><span class="bar-track"><i style="height:${Math.max(8,count/max*100)}%"></i></span><span class="bar-label">${esc(day.slice(5))}</span></button>`).join('')}</div>`:`<div class="chart-empty compact"><b>No dated events</b><span>Records without timestamps are omitted from this chart.</span></div>`}</div></div>`
}
function showEventSeverity(severity){state.eventSeverity=severity;navigate('Events')}
function showEventDate(date){state.eventDate=date;navigate('Events')}
function clearEventFilters(){state.eventType='';state.eventSeverity='';state.eventDate='';state.localQuery='';render()}
function getKind(id){for(const kind of ['assets','findings','events','correlations','investigations','remediations','audit'])if(byId(kind,id))return kind;return ''}
function entityButton(id){const kind=getKind(id);if(!kind)return `<span class="muted">${esc(id||'Unknown record')}</span>`;const record=byId(kind,id),label=record.name||record.title||id;return `<button class="link" onclick="detail('${kind}','${esc(id)}')">${esc(label)}</button>`}
function metricNavigate(page,filter=''){if(page==='Findings'){state.severity=filter&&filter!=='Open'?filter:'';state.findStatus=filter==='Open'?'Open':''}if(page==='Assets')state.critical='';if(page==='Correlations'){state.correlationFilter='All';state.entityFilter=''}if(page==='Remediation')state.remediationFilter=filter;state.localQuery='';navigate(page)}function overview(){
  const d=state.data,a=d.assets||[],f=d.findings||[],c=d.correlations||[],r=d.remediations||[],events=d.events||[];
  const open=f.filter(x=>x.status==='Open').length,high=f.filter(x=>['High','Critical'].includes(x.severity)),pending=r.filter(x=>['Pending Approval','Verification Pending','Requires Review'].includes(x.status)),verified=c.filter(x=>x.classification==='Verified').length;
  const recent=events.slice().sort((x,y)=>String(y.time||'').localeCompare(String(x.time||''))).slice(0,6),attention=f.filter(x=>x.status==='Open').sort((x,y)=>({Critical:0,High:1,Medium:2,Low:3}[x.severity]??4)-({Critical:0,High:1,Medium:2,Low:3}[y.severity]??4)).slice(0,4);
  const prominent=c.slice().sort((x,y)=>({Verified:0,Potential:1,Unsupported:2}[x.classification]??3)-({Verified:0,Potential:1,Unsupported:2}[y.classification]??3)).slice(0,3);
  return `${head('Security overview','A clear view of recorded activity, evidence and decisions.',`${btn('Start guided demo','startDemo()','primary')}${btn('Re-evaluate links','runCorrelation()')}`)}<div class="overview-sim-note"><span class="sim-dot"></span><span><b>Fictional demonstration workspace</b><small>Records below come from the workspace API. Demo-generated events are labelled synthetic.</small></span><button class="text-action" onclick="navigate('About')">How this works ↗</button></div>
  ${workspaceAccessPanel()}
  ${liveDemoPanel()}
  <section class="metric-strip" aria-label="Security workspace metrics"><button class="metric-tile sky" onclick="metricNavigate('Assets')"><span>Monitored assets</span><b>${a.length}</b><small>Inventory records <i aria-hidden="true">↗</i></small></button><button class="metric-tile coral" onclick="metricNavigate('Findings','Open')"><span>Open findings</span><b>${open}</b><small>${high.length} high or critical <i aria-hidden="true">↗</i></small></button><button class="metric-tile sage" onclick="metricNavigate('Correlations')"><span>Evidence links</span><b>${c.length}</b><small>${verified} verified relationships <i aria-hidden="true">↗</i></small></button><button class="metric-tile butter" onclick="metricNavigate('Remediation','Needs review')"><span>Needs review</span><b>${pending.length}</b><small>Plans awaiting a decision <i aria-hidden="true">↗</i></small></button></section>
  ${assetLandscape(a)}
  <div class="overview-feature-grid"><section class="overview-activity"><div class="overview-section-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">RECORDED ACTIVITY</span><h2>Security timeline</h2><p>Recent events from the API, ordered by recorded time.</p></div><button class="text-action" onclick="navigate('Events')">Open event log ↗</button></div>${recent.length?`<ol class="security-timeline">${recent.map(e=>`<li><span class="timeline-pin ${String(e.severity||'').toLowerCase()}"></span><time>${esc(e.time||'Time not recorded')}</time><button class="link" onclick="detail('events','${esc(e.id)}')">${esc(e.name||e.id)}</button><span class="timeline-context">${esc(entityName(e.assetId))} · ${esc(e.type||'Event')}${e.simulated?` · <b class="synthetic-label">Synthetic demo</b>`:''}</span>${status(e.severity||'Unclassified')}</li>`).join('')}</ol>`:`<div class="chart-empty compact"><b>No event records yet</b><span>The timeline will populate from API event records.</span></div>`}</section>
  <aside class="overview-side-summary"><div class="overview-section-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">EVIDENCE SNAPSHOT</span><h2>Review context</h2></div></div><div class="summary-count"><span>Findings needing attention</span><b>${open}</b><small>${high.length} high or critical</small></div><div class="summary-count"><span>Relationship classifications</span><div class="classification-counts"><i class="verified-dot"></i>${c.filter(x=>x.classification==='Verified').length}<i class="potential-dot"></i>${c.filter(x=>x.classification==='Potential').length}<i class="unsupported-dot"></i>${c.filter(x=>x.classification==='Unsupported').length}</div><small>Verified · Potential · Unsupported</small></div><div class="summary-count"><span>Remediation decisions</span><b>${pending.length}</b><small>Approval, execution and verification are separate.</small></div><button class="text-action" onclick="navigate('Correlations')">Review evidence links ↗</button></aside></div>
  <div class="overview-lower-grid"><section class="overview-attention"><div class="overview-section-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">ANALYST QUEUE</span><h2>Items to review</h2></div><button class="text-action" onclick="navigate('Findings')">All findings ↗</button></div>${attention.length?attention.map(x=>`<button class="attention-line" onclick="detail('findings','${esc(x.id)}')"><span class="attention-priority ${String(x.severity||'').toLowerCase()}"></span><span><b>${esc(x.title||x.id)}</b><small>${esc(entityName(x.assetId))} · ${esc(x.status)} · suggested next step: ${esc(x.next||'Review the available evidence.')}</small></span>${status(x.severity)}</button>`).join(''):empty('No open findings are currently recorded.')}</section>
  <section class="overview-links"><div class="overview-section-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">RELATIONSHIP REVIEW</span><h2>Evidence links</h2></div><button class="text-action" onclick="navigate('Correlations')">All links ↗</button></div>${prominent.length?prominent.map(x=>`<button class="relationship-line" onclick="selectCorrelation('${esc(x.id)}');navigate('Correlations')"><span><b>${esc(entityName(x.source))} <i>↔</i> ${esc(entityName(x.target))}</b><small>${esc(x.explanation||x.type||'Evidence relationship')}</small></span>${status(x.classification)}</button>`).join(''):empty('No relationships are available yet.')}</section></div>
  <section class="overview-analytics"><div class="overview-section-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">DATA DISTRIBUTION</span><h2>Event and finding patterns</h2><p>Visualizations reflect current records only.</p></div><button class="text-action" onclick="navigate('Findings')">Browse findings ↗</button></div><div class="overview-chart-grid"><div><h3>Event analytics</h3>${eventAnalytics(events)}</div><div><h3>Finding severity</h3>${f.length?`<div class="finding-bars">${[['Critical','critical'],['High','high'],['Medium','medium'],['Low','low']].map(([label,key])=>{const n=f.filter(x=>String(x.severity||'').toLowerCase()===key).length;return `<button onclick="metricNavigate('Findings','${label}')"><span class="risk-dot ${key}"></span><span>${label}</span><b>${n}</b><i class="risk-track"><em class="${key}" style="width:${Math.round(n/f.length*100)}%"></em></i></button>`}).join('')}</div>`:`<div class="chart-empty compact"><b>No findings returned</b><span>No severity distribution can be calculated.</span></div>`}</div></div></section>
  <section class="demo-invite"><span><span class="eyebrow">PRESENTER WALKTHROUGH</span><b>Follow a synthetic signal through review</b><small>Inspect linked records, require named approval, then record a separate simulated execution and verification.</small></span>${btn('Begin guided demonstration →','startDemo()','primary')}</section>`
}function entityName(id){for(const k of ['assets','findings','events','investigations','remediations','correlations']){let x=byId(k,id);if(x)return x.name||x.title||x.findingTitle||x.id}return id}function empty(s){return `<div class="empty">${esc(s)}</div>`}
function toolsBar(search=true,filters=''){return `<div class="toolbar">${search?`<input placeholder="Filter this list…" value="${esc(state.localQuery||'')}" oninput="localFilter(this.value)" aria-label="Filter list">`:''}${filters}</div>`}
function filtered(rows,...keys){let q=(state.localQuery||state.query||'').toLowerCase();return rows.filter(x=>!q||keys.some(k=>String(x[k]||'').toLowerCase().includes(q)))}
function assetLandscape(assets){
  const correlations=state.data.correlations||[],connected=correlations.filter(c=>getKind(c.source)==='assets'&&getKind(c.target)==='assets'&&assets.some(a=>a.id===c.source)&&assets.some(a=>a.id===c.target));
  return `<section class="asset-landscape" aria-label="Asset environment landscape"><div class="landscape-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">ASSET ENVIRONMENT · VISUAL MAP</span><h2>Monitored landscape</h2><p>Nodes represent API asset records. Connections appear only when supported by a recorded asset-to-asset correlation.</p></div><span class="landscape-count">${assets.length} assets</span></div>${assets.length?`<div class="landscape-boundary"><svg class="landscape-links" aria-label="Recorded asset relationships"></svg><div class="landscape-caption"><span>FICTIONAL WORKSPACE ENVIRONMENT</span><small>Hover or focus an asset to highlight its recorded links. Select a connection to inspect its evidence.</small></div><div class="landscape-nodes">${assets.map((a,i)=>{const findings=(state.data.findings||[]).filter(f=>f.assetId===a.id),events=(state.data.events||[]).filter(e=>e.assetId===a.id),rels=correlations.filter(c=>c.source===a.id||c.target===a.id);return `<button class="landscape-node ${String(a.criticality||'').toLowerCase()}" data-asset-id="${esc(a.id)}" style="--node-order:${i}" onclick="detail('assets','${esc(a.id)}')" aria-label="Open ${esc(a.name)} details"><span class="landscape-node-top"><i aria-hidden="true">${esc(String(a.type||'Asset').slice(0,1).toUpperCase())}</i><span>${status(a.status||'Unknown')}</span></span><b>${esc(a.name||a.id)}</b><small>${esc(a.type||'Asset')} · ${esc(a.id)}</small><span class="landscape-node-meta"><span>${findings.length} findings</span><span>${events.length} events</span><span>${rels.length} evidence links</span></span><span class="landscape-node-criticality">${esc(a.criticality||'Unrated')} criticality · open details ↗</span></button>`}).join('')}</div>${connected.length?`<p class="landscape-relationships">${connected.length} recorded asset-to-asset relationship${connected.length===1?'':'s'}; line colour indicates the saved classification.</p>`:'<p class="landscape-empty-links">No direct asset-to-asset relationship is recorded. The map shows assets only; it does not infer connections.</p>'}</div>`:`<div class="empty">No assets are available from the API.</div>`}</section>`
}
function assetsPage(){let rows=sortRows(filtered(state.data.assets||[],'name','type','owner','software','criticality','status','observed'),'assets').filter(x=>!state.critical||x.criticality===state.critical);return `${head('Assets','Explore the monitored inventory, then open a record for its evidence and investigation context.',btn('+ Add asset','assetForm()','primary'))}${toolsBar(true,`<select aria-label="Filter by criticality" onchange="filterCritical(this.value)"><option value="">All criticality</option>${['Critical','High','Medium','Low'].map(x=>`<option ${state.critical===x?'selected':''}>${x}</option>`).join('')}</select>`)}${assetLandscape(rows)}<details class="asset-index"><summary>Open searchable inventory table · ${rows.length} assets</summary><div class="table-wrap"><table class="table"><thead><tr><th>${sortHeader('Asset','assets','name')}</th><th>${sortHeader('Type / owner','assets','owner')}</th><th>${sortHeader('Criticality','assets','criticality')}</th><th>${sortHeader('Status','assets','status')}</th><th>Findings</th><th>${sortHeader('Last observed','assets','observed')}</th></tr></thead><tbody>${rows.map(x=>`<tr><td><button class="link" onclick="detail('assets','${esc(x.id)}')">${esc(x.name)}</button><div class="muted">${esc(x.software)}</div></td><td>${esc(x.type)}<div class="muted">${esc(x.owner)}</div></td><td>${status(x.criticality)}</td><td>${status(x.status)}</td><td>${(state.data.findings||[]).filter(f=>f.assetId===x.id).length}</td><td>${esc(x.observed)}</td></tr>`).join('')||'<tr><td colspan="6">No assets match these filters.</td></tr>'}</tbody></table></div></details>`}function findingsPage(){
  let rows=sortRows(filtered(state.data.findings||[],'title','description','severity','status','assetId','detected'),'findings');
  rows=rows.filter(x=>(!state.severity||x.severity===state.severity)&&(!state.findStatus||x.status===state.findStatus));
  return `${head('Security findings','Signals needing context and review. A finding is not proof of compromise.',btn('+ New investigation','investigationForm()','primary'))}${toolsBar(true,`<select aria-label="Filter by severity" onchange="state.severity=this.value;render()"><option value="">All severity</option>${['Critical','High','Medium','Low'].map(x=>`<option ${state.severity===x?'selected':''}>${x}</option>`).join('')}</select><select aria-label="Filter by finding status" onchange="state.findStatus=this.value;render()"><option value="">All status</option>${['Open','Under review','Resolved'].map(x=>`<option ${state.findStatus===x?'selected':''}>${x}</option>`).join('')}</select>`)}<div class="table-meta"><span>${rows.length} findings</span><span>Click a column heading to sort</span></div><div class="table-wrap"><table class="table"><thead><tr><th>${sortHeader('Finding','findings','title')}</th><th>${sortHeader('Severity','findings','severity')}</th><th>${sortHeader('Status','findings','status')}</th><th>Asset</th><th>Source</th><th>Reliability</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody>${rows.map(x=>`<tr><td><button class="link" onclick="detail('findings','${x.id}')">${esc(x.title)}</button><div class="muted">${esc(x.detected)}</div></td><td>${status(x.severity)}</td><td>${status(x.status)}</td><td>${esc(entityName(x.assetId))}</td><td>${esc(x.source)}</td><td>${esc(x.reliability)}</td><td>${btn('Investigate',`investigationForm('${x.id}')`,'small')}</td></tr>`).join('')||'<tr><td colspan="7">No findings match these filters.</td></tr>'}</tbody></table></div>`
}
function eventsPage(){
  let rows=filtered(state.data.events||[],'name','type','description','assetId','severity','time');
  const all=state.data.events||[],types=[...new Set(all.map(x=>x.type).filter(Boolean))],dates=[...new Set(all.map(x=>String(x.time||'').slice(0,10)).filter(x=>/^\d{4}-\d{2}-\d{2}$/.test(x)))].sort().reverse();
  rows=rows.filter(x=>(!state.eventType||x.type===state.eventType)&&(!state.eventSeverity||x.severity===state.eventSeverity)&&(!state.eventDate||String(x.time||'').slice(0,10)===state.eventDate));
  rows=sortRows(rows,'events');
  return `${head('Security events','Review recorded signals with their timestamps, assets, and evidence references.')}<div class="toolbar data-toolbar"><label class="filter-search">⌕<input placeholder="Search event records…" value="${esc(state.localQuery||'')}" oninput="localFilter(this.value)" aria-label="Search events"></label><select aria-label="Filter by event type" onchange="state.eventType=this.value;render()"><option value="">All event types</option>${types.map(x=>`<option ${state.eventType===x?'selected':''}>${esc(x)}</option>`).join('')}</select><select aria-label="Filter by severity" onchange="state.eventSeverity=this.value;render()"><option value="">All severities</option>${['Critical','High','Medium','Low'].map(x=>`<option ${state.eventSeverity===x?'selected':''}>${x}</option>`).join('')}</select><select aria-label="Filter by recorded date" onchange="state.eventDate=this.value;render()"><option value="">All recorded dates</option>${dates.map(x=>`<option value="${x}" ${state.eventDate===x?'selected':''}>${x}</option>`).join('')}</select><label class="sort-select">Sort<select aria-label="Sort events" onchange="setSort('events',this.value)"><option value="time:desc" ${state.sorts.events?.key==='time'&&state.sorts.events?.direction==='desc'?'selected':''}>Newest first</option><option value="time:asc" ${state.sorts.events?.key==='time'&&state.sorts.events?.direction==='asc'?'selected':''}>Oldest first</option><option value="severity:asc" ${state.sorts.events?.key==='severity'?'selected':''}>Severity</option></select></label>${state.eventType||state.eventSeverity||state.eventDate?'<button class="btn small" onclick="clearEventFilters()">Clear filters</button>':''}</div><div class="event-summary"><span>${rows.length} <small>matching records</small></span><span>Showing API data only</span></div><div class="card event-stream">${rows.map(x=>`<button class="event-stream-row" onclick="detail('events','${x.id}')"><span class="event-marker ${String(x.severity||'').toLowerCase()}"></span><span class="event-time">${esc(x.time)}</span><span class="event-stream-main"><b>${esc(x.name)}</b><small>${esc(entityName(x.assetId))} · ${esc(x.type)}<br>${esc(x.description)}<br><span class="evidence-inline">Evidence: ${esc(x.evidence)}</span></small></span>${status(x.severity)}<span class="row-chevron" aria-hidden="true">›</span></button>`).join('')||empty('No event records match these filters.')}</div>`
}
function graph(){let all=state.data.correlations||[],edges=all.filter(e=>(state.correlationFilter==='All'||e.classification===state.correlationFilter)&&(!state.entityFilter||[e.source,e.target].some(id=>getKind(id)===state.entityFilter)));let nodes=[];for(const c of edges)for(const id of [c.source,c.target])if(!nodes.some(n=>n.id===id)){const kind=getKind(id);if(kind)nodes.push({id,type:kind,label:entityName(id)})}const w=760,h=380,cx=w/2,cy=h/2;const pos=nodes.map((n,i)=>({...n,x:cx+Math.cos(i*2*Math.PI/Math.max(1,nodes.length)-Math.PI/2)*Math.min(245,100+nodes.length*12),y:cy+Math.sin(i*2*Math.PI/Math.max(1,nodes.length)-Math.PI/2)*120}));const at=id=>pos.find(n=>n.id===id);return `<svg viewBox="0 0 ${w} ${h}" role="img" aria-label="Evidence graph showing recorded relationships only" style="transform:scale(${state.graphScale});transform-origin:center">${edges.filter(e=>at(e.source)&&at(e.target)).map(e=>{const a=at(e.source),b=at(e.target);return `<line class="edge ${String(e.classification||'').toLowerCase()}" x1="${a.x}" y1="${a.y}" x2="${b.x}" y2="${b.y}" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-label="${esc(entityName(e.source))} to ${esc(entityName(e.target))}, ${esc(e.classification)}" onclick="selectCorrelation('${esc(e.id)}')" onkeydown="if(event.key==='Enter'||event.key===' '){event.preventDefault();selectCorrelation('${esc(e.id)}')}"/>`}).join('')}${pos.map(n=>`<g class="node ${n.type}" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-label="${esc(n.type)}: ${esc(n.label)}" onclick="selectNode('${esc(n.id)}')" onkeydown="if(event.key==='Enter'||event.key===' '){event.preventDefault();selectNode('${esc(n.id)}')}"><title>${esc(n.label)} · ${esc(n.type)}</title><circle cx="${n.x}" cy="${n.y}" r="31"/><text x="${n.x}" y="${n.y+48}">${esc(n.label.slice(0,19))}</text><text x="${n.x}" y="${n.y+4}" style="font-size:10px">${esc(n.type.toUpperCase())}</text></g>`).join('')}</svg>`}
function correlationsPage(){const all=state.data.correlations||[],rel=all.filter(c=>(state.correlationFilter==='All'||c.classification===state.correlationFilter)&&(!state.entityFilter||[c.source,c.target].some(id=>getKind(id)===state.entityFilter))),selected=state.selected&&state.selected.startsWith('COR')?byId('correlations',state.selected):null;return `${head('Evidence correlations','Explore recorded links and inspect what supports or limits each relationship.',btn('Re-evaluate links','runCorrelation()'))}<div class="correlation-filter-bar"><div class="toolbar">${['All','Verified','Potential','Unsupported'].map(x=>`<button class="btn small ${state.correlationFilter===x?'primary':''}" onclick="state.correlationFilter='${x}';render()">${x}</button>`).join('')}</div><label>Entity type <select aria-label="Filter graph by entity type" onchange="state.entityFilter=this.value;render()"><option value="">All entities</option>${[['assets','Assets'],['findings','Findings'],['events','Events'],['investigations','Investigations']].map(([v,label])=>`<option value="${v}" ${state.entityFilter===v?'selected':''}>${label}</option>`).join('')}</select></label></div><div class="split"><section class="card"><div class="card-title">Evidence graph <div class="graph-toolbar"><button class="btn small" onclick="scaleGraph(1.15)" aria-label="Zoom in">＋</button><button class="btn small" onclick="scaleGraph(.87)" aria-label="Zoom out">−</button><button class="btn small" onclick="state.graphScale=1;render()">Fit</button></div></div><div class="graph">${graph()}</div><div class="muted graph-legend">Asset · Finding · Event · Investigation &nbsp; solid: Verified · dashed: Potential · dotted: Unsupported</div></section><aside class="card detail"><h2 class="card-title">${selected?'Relationship evidence':'Select a relationship'}</h2>${selected?correlationDetail(selected):`<p>Choose a recorded relationship from the graph or list to inspect its endpoints, rationale and missing evidence.</p>`}</aside></div><section class="card relationship-review"><h2 class="card-title">Relationship review <span class="muted">${rel.length} relationships</span></h2>${rel.map(c=>`<div class="relationship-review-row"><span class="row-main"><b>${entityButton(c.source)} <i>↔</i> ${entityButton(c.target)}</b><small>${esc(c.type||'Relationship')} · ${esc(c.explanation||'')}</small></span><button class="link classification-link" onclick="selectCorrelation('${esc(c.id)}')">${status(c.classification)} · evidence</button></div>`).join('')||empty('No relationships match these filters.')}</section>`}
function correlationDetail(c){return `<p>${status(c.classification)} · <span class="muted">${esc(c.type||'Relationship')}</span></p><div class="label">Recorded endpoints</div><p>${entityButton(c.source)} <span aria-hidden="true">↔</span> ${entityButton(c.target)}</p><div class="label">Why this classification</div><p>${esc(c.explanation||'No explanation recorded.')}</p><div class="label">Supporting evidence</div><ul>${(c.evidence||[]).map(x=>`<li>${esc(x)}</li>`).join('')||'<li>No supporting evidence recorded.</li>'}</ul><div class="label">Missing evidence</div><ul>${(c.missing||[]).map(x=>`<li>${esc(x)}</li>`).join('')||'<li>No missing evidence currently identified.</li>'}</ul><p class="muted">Last evaluated: ${esc(c.evaluated||'Not recorded')} · a Verified relationship does not itself prove compromise.</p>`}function investigationsPage(){let rows=state.data.investigations||[];return `${head('Investigations','Track analyst review, linked evidence, and explicit status changes.',btn('+ Create investigation','investigationForm()','primary'))}${toolsBar(true,`<select onchange="state.invStatus=this.value;render()"><option value="">All statuses</option>${['Open','In Progress','Pending Review','Resolved','Closed'].map(x=>`<option>${x}</option>`).join('')}</select>`)}<div class="grid" style="grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(280px,1fr))">${rows.filter(x=>(!state.invStatus||x.status===state.invStatus)&&(!state.localQuery||`${x.title} ${x.status} ${x.priority}`.toLowerCase().includes(state.localQuery.toLowerCase()))).map(x=>`<article class="card"><h2 class="card-title">${esc(x.title)}</h2><p>${status(x.status)} &nbsp; ${status(x.priority)}</p><p class="sub">${(x.links||[]).map(l=>esc(entityName(l))).join(' · ')}</p><small class="muted">Updated ${esc(x.updated)}</small><div class="actions" style="margin-top:14px"><button class="btn small" onclick="detail('investigations','${x.id}')">Open investigation</button><button class="btn small" onclick="noteForm('${x.id}')">Add note</button></div></article>`).join('')||empty('No investigations match your filters.')}</div>`}
function workflowRail(r){
  const steps=['Plan review','Approval','Simulation','Verification'];
  const stage=r.status==='Pending Approval'?0:r.status==='Approved'?1:r.status==='Verification Pending'?2:['Verified','Failed','Requires Review'].includes(r.status)?3:0;
  const rejected=r.status==='Rejected';
  return `<div class="workflow-rail ${rejected?'is-rejected':''}" aria-label="Remediation workflow status">${steps.map((label,i)=>`<div class="workflow-step ${i<stage||(!rejected&&i===stage&&stage===3&&r.status==='Verified')?'complete':!rejected&&i===stage?'current':''}"><span class="workflow-index">${i<stage||(!rejected&&i===stage&&stage===3&&r.status==='Verified')?'✓':i+1}</span><span>${label}</span></div>`).join('')}</div>${rejected?'<p class="workflow-note">Plan rejected. No simulated execution was recorded.</p>':r.approver?`<p class="workflow-note">Approval recorded for ${esc(r.approver)}${r.decisionAt?` · ${esc(r.decisionAt)}`:''}. Simulation remains separate from verification.</p>`:''}`
}
function remediationPage(){let rows=state.data.remediations||[];if(state.remediationFilter==='Needs review')rows=rows.filter(r=>['Pending Approval','Verification Pending','Requires Review'].includes(r.status));return `${head('Remediation review','Review each proposal carefully. Approval, simulated execution, and verification remain separate decisions.')}<div class="workflow-intro"><span class="workflow-shield">◇</span><div><b>Human approval required</b><small>Every action is a simulation record only. No device configuration changes.</small></div></div>${state.remediationFilter==='Needs review'?`<div class="table-meta">Showing plans that need review · <button class="text-action" onclick="state.remediationFilter='';render()">Clear filter</button></div>`:''}${rows.map(r=>`<article class="card remediation-card"><div class="remediation-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">${esc(r.id)} · ${esc(r.findingTitle||entityName(r.findingId))}</div><h2>${esc(r.title)}</h2></div>${status(r.status)}</div>${workflowRail(r)}<p class="remediation-action">${esc(r.action)}</p><div class="remediation-facts"><div><span>Expected benefit</span><p>${esc(r.benefit)}</p></div><div><span>Potential impact & risks</span><p>${esc(r.impact)} ${esc(r.risks)}</p></div><div><span>Preconditions</span><p>${esc(r.preconditions)}</p></div><div><span>Verification criteria</span><p>${esc(r.criteria)}</p></div></div>${r.result?`<div class="workflow-result"><span>Recorded outcome</span><p>${esc(r.result)}</p></div>`:''}<div class="actions remediation-actions">${r.status==='Pending Approval'?btn('Review & decide',`approvalForm('${esc(r.id)}')`,'primary'):''}${r.status==='Approved'?btn('Simulate execution',`executeRemediation('${esc(r.id)}')`,'primary'):''}${r.status==='Verification Pending'?btn('Verify outcome',`verifyForm('${esc(r.id)}')`,'primary'):''}</div></article>`).join('')||empty('No remediation plans are available.')}`}function auditPage(){
  let rows=sortRows((state.data.audit||[]).slice().reverse(),'audit');
  rows=rows.filter(x=>(!state.auditOrigin||x.origin===state.auditOrigin)&&(!state.localQuery||JSON.stringify(x).toLowerCase().includes(state.localQuery.toLowerCase())));
  return `${head('Audit trail','Persisted workspace activity, including analyst decisions and recorded system events.')}${toolsBar(true,`<select aria-label="Filter audit origin" onchange="state.auditOrigin=this.value;render()"><option value="">All origins</option><option ${state.auditOrigin==='User'?'selected':''}>User</option><option ${state.auditOrigin==='System'?'selected':''}>System</option></select>`)}<div class="table-meta"><span>${rows.length} audit entries</span><span>Click a column heading to sort</span></div><div class="table-wrap"><table class="table"><thead><tr><th>${sortHeader('Time','audit','time')}</th><th>${sortHeader('Actor','audit','actor')}</th><th>${sortHeader('Action','audit','action')}</th><th>${sortHeader('Entity','audit','entityType')}</th><th>Description</th><th>${sortHeader('Origin','audit','origin')}</th></tr></thead><tbody>${rows.map(x=>`<tr><td>${esc(x.time)}</td><td>${esc(x.actor)}</td><td>${esc(x.action)}</td><td>${esc(x.entityType)} · ${esc(x.entityId)}</td><td>${esc(x.description)}</td><td>${esc(x.origin)}</td></tr>`).join('')||'<tr><td colspan="6">No audit entries match.</td></tr>'}</tbody></table></div>`
}
function settingsPage(){let s=state.data.settings?.[0]||{};return `${head('Settings','Workspace configuration and demo data management.')}<div class="grid cols"><section class="card"><h2 class="card-title">Workspace configuration</h2><div class="field"><label>Workspace name</label><input id="setName" value="${esc(s.name||'')}"></div><div class="field"><label>Organization</label><input id="setOrg" value="${esc(s.organization||'')}"></div><div class="field"><label>Correlation time window (hours)</label><input id="setWindow" type="number" min="1" max="720" value="${esc(s.windowHours||24)}"></div><div class="field"><label>Verified rule</label><input id="setVerified" value="${esc(s.verifiedRule||'')}"></div><div class="field"><label>Potential rule</label><input id="setPotential" value="${esc(s.potentialRule||'')}"></div><p>Simulation mode: <b>${s.simulationMode?'Enabled':'Disabled'}</b>. This demo does not connect to real systems.</p>${btn('Save settings','saveSettings()','primary')}</section><section class="card"><h2 class="card-title">Demo data</h2><p class="sub">Restore the Northstar Dental Clinic fictional seed workspace. This permanently replaces current local demo records.</p>${btn('Reset demo workspace','confirmReset()','danger')}<hr style="border-color:var(--line);margin:25px 0"><h2 class="card-title">API health</h2><p>Process liveness and database readiness are checked separately.</p>${btn('Check health','checkHealth()')}</section></div>`}
function aboutPage(){return `${head('About CyberRakshak AI','Evidence-led security triage and safe remediation guidance for small organizations.',btn('Replay introduction','replayIntro()'))}<div class="grid cols"><section class="card"><h2 class="card-title">Understand the evidence before acting</h2><p>CyberRakshak helps small businesses organize available assets, findings, and events into explainable investigations. Correlations show what supports a relationship, what is missing, and why records should remain separate.</p><p>It is intended for small-business owners and analysts who need a practical starting point for security review. It uses transparent correlation rules, not unsupported AI claims.</p><h3>Simulation-only behavior</h3><p>All data in this workspace is fictional. Correlation is local to the supplied dataset. No network scans run; no endpoint, firewall, or application is changed. Remediation execution records a simulated result only.</p><h3>Limitations</h3><p>Analysis may be incomplete or inaccurate. The sample evidence is not a substitute for forensic work or a qualified cybersecurity professional. A verified relationship means evidence supports a connection, not that compromise occurred.</p></section><section class="card"><h2 class="card-title">Disclaimer</h2><div class="disclaimer">${DISCLAIMER}</div><p style="margin-top:16px">This disclaimer is available here at any time. It is also presented during the guided demo before investigation begins.</p></section></div>`}
let revealObserver=null,assetResizeBound=false;
function setupSectionReveals(page){revealObserver?.disconnect();const targets=page.querySelectorAll('.overview-sim-note,.metric-strip,.asset-landscape,.overview-feature-grid,.overview-lower-grid,.overview-analytics,.demo-invite,.landscape-boundary,.asset-index,.workflow-shell,.live-demo-card');if(!targets.length)return;targets.forEach(x=>x.classList.add('reveal-on-scroll'));if(!('IntersectionObserver' in window)){targets.forEach(x=>x.classList.add('is-visible'));return}revealObserver=new IntersectionObserver(entries=>entries.forEach(e=>{if(e.isIntersecting){e.target.classList.add('is-visible');revealObserver.unobserve(e.target)}}),{threshold:.08,rootMargin:'0px 0px -35px 0px'});targets.forEach(x=>revealObserver.observe(x))}
function updateAssetNetwork(){
  document.querySelectorAll('.landscape-boundary').forEach(boundary=>{const svg=boundary.querySelector('.landscape-links'),nodes=[...boundary.querySelectorAll('.landscape-node')];if(!svg||!nodes.length)return;const rect=boundary.getBoundingClientRect(),w=Math.max(1,rect.width),h=Math.max(1,rect.height),byId=new Map(nodes.map(node=>[node.dataset.assetId,node]));svg.setAttribute('viewBox',`0 0 ${w} ${h}`);svg.setAttribute('preserveAspectRatio','none');svg.setAttribute('width',w);svg.setAttribute('height',h);const links=(state.data.correlations||[]).filter(c=>byId.has(c.source)&&byId.has(c.target));svg.innerHTML=links.map(c=>{const a=byId.get(c.source).getBoundingClientRect(),b=byId.get(c.target).getBoundingClientRect(),x1=a.left+a.width/2-rect.left,y1=a.top+a.height/2-rect.top,x2=b.left+b.width/2-rect.left,y2=b.top+b.height/2-rect.top,classification=String(c.classification||'Unsupported').toLowerCase();return `<line class="landscape-edge ${esc(classification)}" data-from="${esc(c.source)}" data-to="${esc(c.target)}" data-correlation-id="${esc(c.id)}" x1="${x1}" y1="${y1}" x2="${x2}" y2="${y2}" tabindex="0" role="button" aria-label="Open ${esc(c.classification||'Unclassified')} relationship evidence: ${esc(c.type||c.id)}"><title>${esc(c.classification||'Unclassified')}: ${esc(c.type||c.id)}</title></line>`}).join('');svg.querySelectorAll('[data-correlation-id]').forEach(edge=>{const open=()=>{const c=byId('correlations',edge.dataset.correlationId);if(c){state.selected=c.id;navigate('Correlations')}};edge.addEventListener('click',open);edge.addEventListener('keydown',e=>{if(e.key==='Enter'||e.key===' '){e.preventDefault();open()}})});nodes.forEach(node=>{if(node.dataset.networkBound)return;node.dataset.networkBound='true';const highlight=()=>svg.querySelectorAll('.landscape-edge').forEach(edge=>edge.classList.toggle('is-related',edge.dataset.from===node.dataset.assetId||edge.dataset.to===node.dataset.assetId));const clear=()=>svg.querySelectorAll('.landscape-edge').forEach(edge=>edge.classList.remove('is-related'));node.addEventListener('mouseenter',highlight);node.addEventListener('mouseleave',clear);node.addEventListener('focus',highlight);node.addEventListener('blur',clear)});if(!assetResizeBound){window.addEventListener('resize',updateAssetNetwork,{passive:true});assetResizeBound=true}})
}
function render(){let app=$('#app');if(!app)return;app.innerHTML=shell();const page=app.querySelector('.page'),heading=app.querySelector('.page-head h1');if(heading&&state.lastRenderedPage!==state.page){state.lastRenderedPage=state.page;page?.classList.add('section-entering');if(heading.tabIndex<0)heading.focus({preventScroll:true});if(page)setupSectionReveals(page);setTimeout(()=>page?.classList.remove('section-entering'),1300)}updateAssetNetwork()}
function navigate(p){state.page=p;state.menu=false;state.localQuery='';render()}
function toggleMenu(){state.menu=!state.menu;render()}
function toggleSidebar(){state.sidebarCollapsed=!state.sidebarCollapsed;render()}
function sortRows(rows,scope){let cfg=state.sorts[scope];if(!cfg)return rows;return rows.slice().sort((a,b)=>{let av=String(a[cfg.key]??''),bv=String(b[cfg.key]??'');let n=av.localeCompare(bv,undefined,{numeric:true,sensitivity:'base'});return cfg.direction==='desc'?-n:n})}
function setSort(scope,value){let [key,direction]=value.split(':');state.sorts[scope]={key,direction};render()}
function sortHeader(label,scope,key){let active=state.sorts[scope]?.key===key,dir=active?state.sorts[scope].direction:'asc';return `<button class="sort-heading" onclick="setSort('${scope}','${key}:${active&&dir==='asc'?'desc':'asc'}')" aria-label="Sort by ${label}">${label}<span aria-hidden="true">${active?(dir==='asc'?'↑':'↓'):'↕'}</span></button>`}
function globalSearch(v){state.query=v;render();let i=$('.search');i?.focus();i?.setSelectionRange(v.length,v.length)}
function localFilter(v){state.localQuery=v;let p=state.page;render();let i=$('.toolbar input');i?.focus();i?.setSelectionRange(v.length,v.length)}
function filterCritical(v){state.critical=v;render()}
function scaleGraph(v){state.graphScale=Math.max(.65,Math.min(1.6,state.graphScale*v));render()}
function selectCorrelation(id){state.selected=id;render()}
function selectNode(id){const kind=getKind(id);if(kind==='correlations'){selectCorrelation(id);return}if(kind)detail(kind,id)}
function formModal(title,body,onSave,label='Save'){modal(`<h2>${title}</h2>${body}<div id="formError" class="alert" style="display:none;margin-top:12px"></div><div class="modal-actions"><button class="btn" onclick="closeModal()">Cancel</button><button class="btn primary" onclick="${onSave}">${label}</button></div>`)}
function modal(content,drawer=false){$('#modal-root').innerHTML=`<div class="modal-backdrop ${drawer?'drawer-backdrop':''}" onclick="if(event.target===this)closeModal()"><section class="modal ${drawer?'detail-drawer':''}" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-label="${drawer?'Record details':'Workspace dialog'}" tabindex="-1">${content}</section></div>`;$('.modal')?.focus()}
function showOnboarding(){modal(`<div class="eyebrow">WELCOME · SIMULATION WORKSPACE</div><h2>Welcome to CyberRakshak AI</h2><p>This Northstar Dental Clinic workspace contains fictional assets and simulated evidence. You can inspect relationships, create investigations, and review remediation decisions. No real-world security operation is performed.</p><h3>Disclaimer</h3><div class="disclaimer">${DISCLAIMER}</div><div class="modal-actions"><button class="btn primary" onclick="localStorage.setItem('cr-onboarded','yes');closeModal()">Continue to workspace</button></div>`)}
function closeModal(){if(state.demo?.waiting){state.demo.waiting=false;demoShow();return}$('#modal-root').innerHTML=''}
function demoOpenDetail(kind,rid){state.demo.waiting=true;$('#modal-root').innerHTML='';detail(kind,rid)}
function demoOpenPage(page){state.demo.waiting=true;state.page=page;render()}
function demoRemediationAction(){let r=byId('remediations','REM-401');state.demo.waiting=true;$('#modal-root').innerHTML='';if(r.status==='Approved')executeRemediation(r.id);else if(r.status==='Verification Pending')verifyForm(r.id);else{state.demo.waiting=false;demoOpenPage('Remediation')}}
function resumeDemo(){if(!state.demo)return;state.demo.waiting=false;state.demo.step=Math.min(state.demo.step+1,demoSteps.length-1);demoShow()}
function linkedCorrelations(ids){const set=new Set(ids.filter(Boolean));return (state.data.correlations||[]).filter(c=>set.has(c.source)||set.has(c.target))}
function recordRows(records,kind){return records.length?records.map(r=>`<p class="linked-record-line">${entityButton(r.id)} ${kind==='correlations'?status(r.classification):''}</p>`).join(''):`<p class="muted">No linked ${kind} records.</p>`}
function relatedInvestigationLinks(ids){return (state.data.investigations||[]).filter(i=>(i.links||[]).some(l=>ids.includes(l)))}
function detail(kind,rid){let x=byId(kind,rid);if(!x)return;let title=x.name||x.title||x.id,body='';if(kind==='assets'){const findings=(state.data.findings||[]).filter(f=>f.assetId===x.id),events=(state.data.events||[]).filter(e=>e.assetId===x.id),ids=[x.id,...findings.map(f=>f.id),...events.map(e=>e.id)],corr=linkedCorrelations(ids),invs=relatedInvestigationLinks(ids),rem=(state.data.remediations||[]).filter(r=>findings.some(f=>f.id===r.findingId));body=`<div class="asset-detail-intro"><p>${status(x.criticality)} ${status(x.status)}</p><p><b>${esc(x.id)}</b> · ${esc(x.type||'Asset')}</p><p>${esc(x.owner||'Owner not recorded')} · ${esc(x.software||'Software not recorded')}</p><p>Last observed: ${esc(x.observed||'Not recorded')}</p><p class="context-note">${x.criticality?`This asset is rated ${esc(x.criticality)} criticality. `:''}${findings.length?`It has ${findings.length} linked finding${findings.length===1?'':'s'} and ${events.length} linked event${events.length===1?'':'s'} in this workspace.`:'No finding or event is currently linked by asset identifier.'}</p></div><h3>Linked findings</h3>${findings.length?findings.map(f=>`<p>${entityButton(f.id)} ${status(f.severity)}<small class="muted"> ${esc(f.status||'')}</small></p>`).join(''):'<p>No findings link this asset.</p>'}<h3>Recorded events</h3>${recordRows(events,'events')}<h3>Correlations involving linked records</h3>${recordRows(corr,'correlations')}<h3>Investigations</h3>${recordRows(invs,'investigations')}<h3>Remediation plans for linked findings</h3>${recordRows(rem,'remediations')}<div class="modal-actions">${btn('← Back to landscape','closeModal()')}${btn('Edit asset',`assetForm('${esc(x.id)}')`)}${btn('Delete asset',`deleteAsset('${esc(x.id)}')`,'danger')}</div>`}else if(kind==='findings'){const evidenceEvents=(x.evidence||[]).map(id=>byId('events',id)).filter(Boolean),correlatedEvents=linkedCorrelations([x.id]).flatMap(c=>[c.source,c.target]).filter(id=>id!==x.id&&getKind(id)==='events').map(id=>byId('events',id)).filter(Boolean),events=[...new Map([...evidenceEvents,...correlatedEvents].map(e=>[e.id,e])).values()],corr=linkedCorrelations([x.id,...events.map(e=>e.id),x.assetId]),invs=relatedInvestigationLinks([x.id,x.assetId,...events.map(e=>e.id)]);body=`<p>${status(x.severity)} ${status(x.status)}</p><p>${esc(x.description||'No description recorded.')}</p><p>Asset: ${entityButton(x.assetId)} · ${esc(x.source||'Source not recorded')}</p><p>Detected ${esc(x.detected||'time not recorded')} · reliability ${esc(x.reliability||'not recorded')}</p><h3>Supporting evidence</h3>${events.length?events.map(e=>`<p>${entityButton(e.id)} · ${esc(e.description||e.evidence||'')}</p>`).join(''):'<p>No linked event records were returned.</p>'}<h3>Related correlations</h3>${recordRows(corr,'correlations')}<h3>Related investigations</h3>${recordRows(invs,'investigations')}<h3>Suggested next step</h3><p>${esc(x.next||'Review the available evidence and record remaining uncertainties.')}</p><div class="modal-actions">${btn('Create investigation',`closeModal();investigationForm('${esc(x.id)}')`,'primary')}${btn('Review finding',`findingStatusForm('${esc(x.id)}')`)}</div>`}else if(kind==='events'){const directlyLinked=(state.data.findings||[]).filter(f=>(f.evidence||[]).includes(x.id)),correlationLinked=linkedCorrelations([x.id]).flatMap(c=>[c.source,c.target]).filter(id=>id!==x.id&&getKind(id)==='findings').map(id=>byId('findings',id)).filter(Boolean),findings=[...new Map([...directlyLinked,...correlationLinked].map(f=>[f.id,f])).values()],corr=linkedCorrelations([x.id,x.assetId,...findings.map(f=>f.id)]),invs=relatedInvestigationLinks([x.id,x.assetId,...findings.map(f=>f.id)]);body=`<p>${status(x.severity)} ${esc(x.type||'Event type not recorded')} · reliability ${esc(x.reliability||'not recorded')}</p><p>${esc(x.description||'No description recorded.')}</p><p>Time: ${esc(x.time||'Not recorded')} · Asset: ${entityButton(x.assetId)}</p><p class="simulation-tag">${x.simulated?`Synthetic guided-demo event · ${esc(x.source||'Generated within this workspace')} · no external login attempt occurred.`:'Fictional simulation workspace record · this event was not collected from a real system.'}</p><h3>Evidence and source</h3><p>${esc(x.evidence||'No evidence field recorded.')}</p><p>Source: ${esc(x.source||'Not recorded')}</p><h3>Related findings</h3>${recordRows(findings,'findings')}<h3>Correlations</h3>${recordRows(corr,'correlations')}<h3>Investigations</h3>${recordRows(invs,'investigations')}`}else if(kind==='investigations'){const links=x.links||[],linked=links.map(id=>({id,kind:getKind(id),record:byId(getKind(id),id)})).filter(v=>v.record),corr=linkedCorrelations(links),audit=(state.data.audit||[]).filter(a=>a.entityId===x.id||links.includes(a.entityId)),finding=linked.find(v=>v.kind==='findings')?.record,rem=(state.data.remediations||[]).filter(r=>finding&&r.findingId===finding.id);body=`<p>${status(x.status)} ${status(x.priority)} · created by ${esc(x.createdBy||'Not recorded')}</p><h3>Investigation objective</h3><p>${esc(x.objective||x.next||x.title)}</p><h3>Trigger and linked evidence</h3>${linked.length?linked.map(v=>`<p>${entityButton(v.id)} <small class="muted">${esc(v.kind)}</small></p>`).join(''):'<p>No linked records currently resolve.</p>'}<h3>Correlation assessment</h3>${corr.length?corr.map(c=>`<div class="investigation-correlation"><p>${status(c.classification)} ${entityButton(c.id)}</p><p>${esc(c.explanation||c.type||'')}</p><small><b>Evidence:</b> ${esc((c.evidence||[]).join('; ')||'None recorded')}<br><b>Outstanding:</b> ${esc((c.missing||[]).join('; ')||'No missing evidence listed')}</small></div>`).join(''):'<p>No correlation explicitly links the investigation records.</p>'}<h3>Outstanding questions</h3><p>${esc(x.outstanding||x.next||'Review which additional identity, session or timing evidence would resolve the open questions.')}</p><h3>Recommended next action</h3><p>${esc(x.next||'Review the evidence and document what remains uncertain.')}</p><h3>Remediation status</h3>${recordRows(rem,'remediations')}<h3>Analyst notes</h3>${(x.notes||[]).map(n=>`<p>${esc(n.by)} · ${esc(n.time)}<br>${esc(n.text)}</p>`).join('')||'<p>No analyst notes.</p>'}<h3>Audit history</h3>${audit.length?audit.map(a=>`<p>${esc(a.time)} · ${esc(a.action)} · ${esc(a.description)}</p>`).join(''):'<p>No audit record linked by entity id.</p>'}<div class="field"><label>Update status</label><select id="invNewStatus">${['Open','In Progress','Pending Review','Resolved','Closed'].map(s=>`<option ${s===x.status?'selected':''}>${s}</option>`).join('')}</select></div><div class="modal-actions">${btn('Add note',`noteForm('${esc(x.id)}')`)}${btn('Save status',`updateInvestigation('${esc(x.id)}')`,'primary')}</div>`}else if(kind==='correlations'){body=correlationDetail(x)}else if(kind==='remediations'){body=`<p>${status(x.status)}</p><p>${esc(x.action||x.title)}</p><p>${esc(x.result||'No outcome recorded.')}</p>`}else{body=`<pre>${esc(JSON.stringify(x,null,2))}</pre>`}modal(`<div class="drawer-kicker">${esc(kind.toUpperCase())} · RECORD DETAIL</div><h2>${esc(title)}</h2>${body}<div class="modal-actions"><button class="btn" onclick="closeModal()">Close</button></div>`,true)}function assetForm(rid){let x=rid?byId('assets',rid):{};formModal(rid?'Edit asset':'Add asset',`<div class="field"><label>Asset name</label><input id="aName" value="${esc(x.name||'')}"></div><div class="field"><label>Asset type</label><select id="aType">${['Workstation','Server','Network device','Application'].map(v=>`<option ${v===x.type?'selected':''}>${v}</option>`).join('')}</select></div><div class="field"><label>Owner / department</label><input id="aOwner" value="${esc(x.owner||'')}"></div><div class="field"><label>Software / operating system</label><input id="aSoftware" value="${esc(x.software||'')}"></div><div class="field"><label>Criticality</label><select id="aCritical">${['Low','Medium','High','Critical'].map(v=>`<option ${v===x.criticality?'selected':''}>${v}</option>`).join('')}</select></div>`,`saveAsset('${rid||''}')`)}
async function saveAsset(rid){let name=$('#aName').value.trim(),owner=$('#aOwner').value.trim();if(!name||!owner)return showFormError('Asset name and owner are required.');let x={id:rid||id('AST'),name,type:$('#aType').value,owner,software:$('#aSoftware').value.trim(),criticality:$('#aCritical').value,status:'Monitored',observed:now()};if(rid){let old=byId('assets',rid);x={...old,...x}}await save('assets',x);closeModal()}
function showFormError(s){let e=$('#formError');e.textContent=s;e.style.display='block'}
function investigationForm(findingId=''){let f=byId('findings',findingId);formModal('Create investigation',`<div class="field"><label>Investigation title</label><input id="iTitle" value="${esc(f?'Review '+f.title:'')}"></div><div class="field"><label>Priority</label><select id="iPriority">${['Critical','High','Medium','Low'].map(v=>`<option ${v===(f?.severity||'Medium')?'selected':''}>${v}</option>`).join('')}</select></div><div class="field"><label>Linked finding</label><select id="iFinding"><option value="">Choose a finding</option>${(state.data.findings||[]).map(v=>`<option value="${v.id}" ${v.id===findingId?'selected':''}>${esc(v.title)}</option>`).join('')}</select></div><p class="muted">The affected asset and supporting events are linked automatically when a finding is selected.</p>`,`createInvestigation()`)}
async function createInvestigation(){let f=byId('findings',$('#iFinding').value),title=$('#iTitle').value.trim();if(!title)return showFormError('Enter an investigation title.');let links=f?[f.id,f.assetId,...(f.evidence||[])]:[];await save('investigations',{id:id('INV'),title,status:'Open',priority:$('#iPriority').value,links,notes:[],createdBy:'Workspace analyst',created:new Date().toISOString(),updated:new Date().toISOString(),next:f?.next||'Gather and review supporting evidence.'});closeModal();navigate('Investigations')}
function noteForm(rid){let inv=byId('investigations',rid);closeModal();formModal('Add analyst note',`<p>${esc(inv?.title)}</p><div class="field"><label>Note</label><textarea id="noteText" placeholder="Record what was reviewed and what remains unknown"></textarea></div>`,`addNote('${rid}')`)}
async function addNote(rid){let text=$('#noteText').value.trim();if(!text)return showFormError('Enter a note.');let x=byId('investigations',rid);x.notes=[...(x.notes||[]),{by:'Workspace analyst',time:new Date().toISOString(),text}];x.updated=new Date().toISOString();await save('investigations',x);closeModal();detail('investigations',rid)}
async function updateInvestigation(rid){let x=byId('investigations',rid),old=x.status,next=$('#invNewStatus').value;if(next==='Resolved'&&old!=='Resolved'){closeModal();formModal('Resolve investigation',`<div class="alert">Resolution is an explicit analyst decision. Record what verification was reviewed before marking this investigation resolved.</div><div class="field"><label>Verification reviewed</label><textarea id="resolveEvidence" placeholder="What evidence supports resolution? What limitations remain?"></textarea></div>`,`confirmResolve('${rid}')`,'Record resolution')}else{x.status=next;x.updated=new Date().toISOString();await api('investigations',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify({...x,_action:'status changed',_description:`Investigation status changed from ${old} to ${next}`})});await refresh();detail('investigations',rid)}}
async function confirmResolve(rid){let note=$('#resolveEvidence').value.trim();if(!note)return showFormError('Record the verification evidence and remaining limitations.');let x=byId('investigations',rid),old=x.status;x.status='Resolved';x.notes=[...(x.notes||[]),{by:'Workspace analyst',time:new Date().toISOString(),text:`Resolution verification: ${note}`}];x.updated=new Date().toISOString();await api('investigations',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify({...x,_action:'status changed',_description:`Investigation status changed from ${old} to Resolved after verification was recorded`})});await refresh();closeModal();detail('investigations',rid)}
function findingStatusForm(rid){let x=byId('findings',rid);formModal('Update finding status',`<p>${esc(x.title)}</p><div class="field"><label>Status</label><select id="findingStatus">${['Open','Under review','Resolved'].map(s=>`<option ${s===x.status?'selected':''}>${s}</option>`).join('')}</select></div><p class="muted">Resolution is a user-recorded status and does not remove original evidence.</p>`,`saveFindingStatus('${rid}')`)}
async function saveFindingStatus(rid){let x=byId('findings',rid),old=x.status;x.status=$('#findingStatus').value;await api('findings',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify({...x,_action:'status changed',_description:`Finding status changed from ${old} to ${x.status}`})});await refresh();closeModal()}
async function deleteAsset(rid){closeModal();formModal('Delete asset?',`<div class="alert">Delete ${esc(entityName(rid))}? This action cannot be undone. Assets with linked events or findings cannot be deleted.</div>`,`doDeleteAsset('${rid}')`,'Confirm delete')}
async function doDeleteAsset(rid){try{await api('assets/'+rid,{method:'DELETE'});await refresh();closeModal()}catch(e){showFormError(e.message)}}
function approvalForm(rid){let r=byId('remediations',rid);formModal('Review remediation plan',`<div class="alert">Simulation only. No device configuration will change.</div><h3>${esc(r.title)}</h3><p>${esc(r.action)}</p><p><b>Potential impact:</b> ${esc(r.impact)}</p><p><b>Risks:</b> ${esc(r.risks)}</p><p><b>Preconditions:</b> ${esc(r.preconditions)}</p><div class="field"><label>Approver name</label><input id="approver" placeholder="Your name"></div><label style="display:flex;gap:9px;align-items:flex-start;line-height:1.5"><input id="ack" type="checkbox" style="margin-top:4px"> I reviewed the proposed action, impact, and risks, and approve a simulated execution record.</label><div class="actions" style="margin-top:13px">${btn('Reject plan',`decideRemediation('${rid}','Rejected')`,'danger')}</div>`,`decideRemediation('${rid}','Approved')`,'Approve simulation')}
async function decideRemediation(rid,decision){let r=byId('remediations',rid);if(decision==='Approved'){let n=$('#approver')?.value.trim();if(!n)return showFormError('Enter the approver name.');if(!$('#ack')?.checked)return showFormError('Acknowledge the impact and simulation scope before approval.');r.approver=n}r.status=decision;r.decisionAt=new Date().toISOString();r.result=decision==='Approved'?'Approved for simulated execution.':'Rejected by reviewer.';await api('remediations',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify({...r,_action:`remediation ${decision.toLowerCase()}`,_description:`${decision} remediation ${rid}${r.approver?' by '+r.approver:''}`})});await refresh();closeModal()}
async function executeRemediation(rid){let r=byId('remediations',rid);formModal('Simulate execution',`<div class="alert">This records a simulated outcome only. Nothing will be sent to a device.</div><p>${esc(r.action)}</p><p>Approval recorded by ${esc(r.approver)}.</p><p>Execution will not mark this plan verified. Verification is a separate step.</p>`,`confirmExecution('${rid}')`,'Record simulated execution')}
async function confirmExecution(rid){let r=byId('remediations',rid);r.status='Verification Pending';r.executedAt=new Date().toISOString();r.result='Simulation recorded. Verification is pending.';await api('remediations',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify({...r,_action:'simulated execution recorded',_description:`Simulated execution recorded for ${rid}; no system was changed`})});await refresh();closeModal()}
function verifyForm(rid){let r=byId('remediations',rid);formModal('Verify simulated outcome',`<p><b>Criteria:</b> ${esc(r.criteria)}</p><p><b>Available evidence:</b> ${esc((r.evidence||[]).join('; ')||'No post-action evidence has been collected. Review the criteria before recording a result.')}</p><div class="field"><label>Verification result</label><select id="verifyResult"><option value="pass">Criteria met in simulated review</option><option value="fail">Criteria not met</option><option value="review">Insufficient evidence · requires review</option></select></div><div class="field"><label>What was checked?</label><textarea id="verifyNote" placeholder="Describe the evidence reviewed"></textarea></div><p class="muted">The simulated action itself is not proof that the finding was fixed.</p>`,`verifyRemediation('${rid}')`,'Record verification')}
async function verifyRemediation(rid){let r=byId('remediations',rid),result=$('#verifyResult').value,note=$('#verifyNote').value.trim();if(!note)return showFormError('Describe what was checked.');r.status=result==='pass'?'Verified':result==='fail'?'Failed':'Requires Review';r.verifiedAt=new Date().toISOString();r.result=`${result==='pass'?'Criteria passed':result==='fail'?'Criteria not met':'Insufficient evidence'}: ${note}`;r.evidence=note;await api('remediations',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify({...r,_action:'verification recorded',_description:`${r.status} verification for ${rid}: ${note}`})});await refresh();closeModal()}
async function runCorrelation(){let rows=state.data.correlations||[];let stamp=new Date().toISOString();for(let c of rows){c.evaluated=stamp;await api('correlations',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify({...c,_action:'relationship re-evaluated',_description:`Re-evaluated ${c.id}: ${c.classification}; evidence and missing evidence retained`})})}await refresh();state.page='Correlations';render()}
async function saveSettings(){let s=state.data.settings[0],w=Number($('#setWindow').value),name=$('#setName').value.trim();if(!name||!Number.isInteger(w)||w<1||w>720)return modal(`<h2>Check settings</h2><p>Workspace name is required and the time window must be between 1 and 720 whole hours.</p><div class="modal-actions"><button class="btn" onclick="closeModal()">Close</button></div>`);let x={...s,name,organization:$('#setOrg').value.trim(),windowHours:w,verifiedRule:$('#setVerified').value.trim(),potentialRule:$('#setPotential').value.trim()};await api('settings',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify({...x,_action:'settings updated',_description:'Workspace configuration updated'})});await refresh()}
function confirmReset(){formModal('Reset demo workspace?',`<div class="alert">This replaces local workspace records with the fictional Northstar Dental Clinic demo dataset. The reset action is recorded in the audit trail after seed data is restored.</div><p>Assets, findings, events, investigations, and remediation decisions will return to their original demo state.</p>`,`doReset()`,'Reset workspace')}
async function doReset(){await api('reset',{method:'POST',body:'{}'});await refresh();closeModal()}
async function checkHealth(){try{let a=await fetch(`${API_BASE}/api/live`).then(x=>x.json()),b=await fetch(`${API_BASE}/api/ready`).then(x=>x.json());modal(`<h2>API health</h2><p>Process liveness: <b>${esc(a.status)}</b></p><p>Database readiness: <b>${esc(b.status)}</b> · ${esc(b.database)}</p><div class="modal-actions"><button class="btn" onclick="closeModal()">Close</button></div>`)}catch(e){modal(`<h2>API health</h2><p class="alert">Health check failed: ${esc(e.message)}</p><div class="modal-actions"><button class="btn" onclick="closeModal()">Close</button></div>`)} }
const guidedSteps=[{page:'Overview',title:'Establish the fictional environment',observe:'Review actual workspace counts and recorded events. This is demonstration data, not a live security monitor.'},{page:'Assets',title:'Explore the affected asset',observe:'Open the selected asset to see findings and events linked by asset ID in the current data.'},{page:'Events',title:'Introduce a synthetic event',observe:'Create one clearly labelled simulated authentication event using the existing events API. No external login attempt or network activity occurs.'},{page:'Correlations',title:'Assess the evidence',observe:'Inspect the Potential relationship. Shared context is not proof of successful login; missing evidence remains visible.'},{page:'Investigations',title:'Investigate in context',observe:'Review linked evidence, outstanding questions and the correlation assessment. No relationship is inferred from graph layout.'},{page:'Remediation',title:'Review a proposed response',observe:'Read the fictional plan, impact, risks and preconditions. It records no device change.'},{page:'Remediation',title:'Require a named approval',observe:'A reviewer enters a name and explicitly acknowledges the simulation scope, or rejects the plan.'},{page:'Remediation',title:'Record simulated execution',observe:'Only after approval, record simulated execution. Execution does not mark the plan verified.'},{page:'Remediation',title:'Verify separately',observe:'Choose pass, fail or insufficient evidence and enter what was checked. No real-world fix is claimed.'},{page:'Audit Trail',title:'Inspect the audit trail',observe:'Review event, investigation, approval, execution and verification entries actually written to this workspace.'}];
function demoContext(){const findings=(state.data.findings||[]).filter(f=>f.assetId&&byId('assets',f.assetId));findings.sort((a,b)=>({Critical:0,High:1,Medium:2,Low:3}[a.severity]??4)-({Critical:0,High:1,Medium:2,Low:3}[b.severity]??4));const finding=findings.find(f=>f.status==='Open')||findings[0];if(!finding)return null;const asset=byId('assets',finding.assetId),investigation=(state.data.investigations||[]).find(i=>(i.links||[]).includes(finding.id)&&(i.status==='Open'||i.status==='In Progress'))||(state.data.investigations||[]).find(i=>(i.links||[]).includes(finding.id)),remediation=(state.data.remediations||[]).find(r=>r.findingId===finding.id);return {findingId:finding.id,assetId:asset?.id,eventId:`EV-DEMO-${finding.id}`,correlationId:`COR-DEMO-${finding.id}`,investigationId:investigation?.id||`INV-DEMO-${finding.id}`,remediationId:remediation?.id||`REM-DEMO-${finding.id}`}}
function startDemo(){const context=demoContext();if(!context){modal(`<h2>Demo needs an asset-linked finding</h2><p>The current API data has no finding linked to an existing asset, so a contextual scenario cannot start.</p><button class="btn" onclick="closeModal()">Close</button>`);return}state.demo={step:0,...context,eventReady:!!byId('events',context.eventId)};state.page='Overview';state.menu=false;render()}
function demoGuide(){const d=state.demo,step=guidedSteps[d.step],r=byId('remediations',d.remediationId);let action='';if(d.step===2)action=d.eventReady?`<span class="demo-complete">Synthetic event is present in API data.</span>`:`<button class="btn primary" onclick="createGuidedDemoRecords()">Generate synthetic demo event</button>`;if(d.step===5&&r?.status==='Pending Approval')action=`<button class="btn primary" onclick="approvalForm('${esc(r.id)}')">Review proposed response</button>`;if(d.step===6)action=r?.status==='Pending Approval'?`<button class="btn primary" onclick="approvalForm('${esc(r.id)}')">Review and decide</button>`:`<span class="demo-state">Current plan state: ${esc(r?.status||'No plan')}.</span>`;if(d.step===7){if(r?.status==='Approved')action=`<button class="btn primary" onclick="executeRemediation('${esc(r.id)}')">Record simulated execution</button>`;else if(['Verification Pending','Verified','Failed','Requires Review'].includes(r?.status))action=`<span class="demo-complete">Execution is recorded. Current plan state: ${esc(r.status)}. Verification remains a separate step.</span>`;else action=`<span class="demo-state">Execution is unavailable until a named reviewer approves the plan. Current state: ${esc(r?.status||'No plan')}.</span>`}if(d.step===8){if(r?.status==='Verification Pending')action=`<button class="btn primary" onclick="verifyForm('${esc(r.id)}')">Record separate verification</button>`;else if(['Verified','Failed','Requires Review'].includes(r?.status))action=`<span class="demo-state">Verification recorded: ${esc(r.status)}. ${esc(r.result||'')}</span>`;else action=`<span class="demo-state">No execution is recorded, so verification is not available. Current state: ${esc(r?.status||'No plan')}.</span>`}if(d.step===9)action=`<button class="btn" onclick="navigate('Audit Trail')">Refresh audit trail</button>`;return `<section class="guided-presenter" aria-labelledby="guided-title"><div class="guided-progress"><span class="simulation-tag">GUIDED DEMONSTRATION · SYNTHETIC</span><span>Step ${d.step+1} of ${guidedSteps.length}</span><button class="text-action" onclick="exitDemo()">Exit demo</button></div><div class="guided-track" aria-hidden="true">${guidedSteps.map((_,i)=>`<i class="${i<d.step?'complete':i===d.step?'current':''}"></i>`).join('')}</div><div class="guided-copy"><span class="eyebrow">${step.page.toUpperCase()}</span><h2 id="guided-title">${esc(step.title)}</h2><p><b>Presenter cue:</b> ${esc(step.observe)}</p><small>Context: ${esc(entityName(d.assetId))} · ${esc(byId('findings',d.findingId)?.title||d.findingId)}${d.eventReady?' · Synthetic event linked':''}</small></div><div class="guided-actions">${action}<span class="guided-spacer"></span><button class="btn small" onclick="demoPrevious()" ${d.step===0?'disabled':''}>Previous</button><button class="btn small" onclick="skipDemoStep()">Skip step</button><button class="btn small primary" onclick="demoNext()">${d.step===guidedSteps.length-1?'Finish':'Next'}</button></div></section>`}function pageContent(){const content=basePageContent();return `${state.demo?demoGuide():''}${content}`}
function demoNavigate(step){const d=state.demo;if(!d)return;d.step=step;state.page=guidedSteps[step].page;state.menu=false;state.localQuery='';if(step===3){state.correlationFilter='Potential';state.entityFilter='';state.selected=d.correlationId}render();if(step===1)setTimeout(()=>detail('assets',d.assetId),0);if(step===2&&d.eventReady)setTimeout(()=>detail('events',d.eventId),0);if(step===4&&byId('investigations',d.investigationId))setTimeout(()=>detail('investigations',d.investigationId),0);scrollTo({top:0,behavior:'smooth'})}
function demoNext(){if(!state.demo)return;if(state.demo.step>=guidedSteps.length-1){exitDemo();return}demoNavigate(state.demo.step+1)}function demoPrevious(){if(state.demo?.step>0)demoNavigate(state.demo.step-1)}function skipDemoStep(){demoNext()}function exitDemo(){state.demo=null;state.correlationFilter='All';state.entityFilter='';navigate('Overview')}
async function createGuidedDemoRecords(){const d=state.demo;if(!d)return;const finding=byId('findings',d.findingId),asset=byId('assets',d.assetId);if(!finding||!asset)return modal(`<h2>Demo context changed</h2><p>Refresh the workspace and start the walkthrough again.</p>`);const eventId=d.eventId,correlationId=d.correlationId,investigationId=d.investigationId,remediationId=d.remediationId;try{if(!byId('events',eventId)){const event={id:eventId,name:'Simulated unverified authentication signal',time:new Date().toISOString(),assetId:asset.id,type:'Authentication',severity:'Medium',reliability:'High',description:`Synthetic guided-demo event for fictional asset ${asset.name}. Generated by an explicit presenter action; no external login attempt occurred.`,evidence:`Internal demo signal only · related finding ${finding.id} · no credentials, tokens or personal information`,source:'CyberRakshak guided demonstration',simulated:true,demoScenario:'guided-auth-review'};await api('events',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify(event)});state.data.events=[...(state.data.events||[]),event]}if(!byId('correlations',correlationId)){const corr={id:correlationId,source:eventId,target:finding.id,type:'Possible authentication context',classification:'Potential',evidence:[`The synthetic event and finding reference the same fictional asset ${asset.id}.`,'The event is marked synthetic and was generated within the guided demo.'],missing:['No successful authentication record is included.','No shared session, account identifier or external identity evidence is available.'],explanation:'Potential contextual link for demonstration only. Shared asset context does not confirm that the event represents the same actor or a compromise.',evaluated:new Date().toISOString()};await api('correlations',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify(corr)});state.data.correlations=[...(state.data.correlations||[]),corr]}let investigation=byId('investigations',investigationId)||((state.data.investigations||[]).find(i=>(i.links||[]).includes(finding.id)));if(!investigation){investigation={id:investigationId,title:`Review synthetic authentication context · ${asset.name}`,objective:'Determine whether fictional event records support a relationship; preserve uncertainty where evidence is missing.',status:'Open',priority:finding.severity||'Medium',links:[finding.id,asset.id,...(finding.evidence||[]),eventId,correlationId],notes:[],createdBy:'Guided demonstration',created:new Date().toISOString(),updated:new Date().toISOString(),next:'Check for a successful-session record or matching account/session identifier; neither is currently supplied.'};await api('investigations',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify(investigation)});state.data.investigations=[...(state.data.investigations||[]),investigation]}else{const links=investigation.links||[];if(!links.includes(eventId)||!links.includes(correlationId)){const updated={...investigation,links:[...new Set([...links,eventId,correlationId])],updated:new Date().toISOString()};await api('investigations',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify(updated)});Object.assign(investigation,{links:updated.links,updated:updated.updated})}}if(!byId('remediations',remediationId)){const plan={id:remediationId,findingId:finding.id,findingTitle:finding.title,title:'Review simulated authentication signal',action:'Review the fictional signal and document whether a source restriction would be justified if this were real. No restriction is applied.',benefit:'Demonstrates a controlled decision record without changing infrastructure.',impact:'No real account, source or device is affected.',risks:'The available event is synthetic; treating it as a confirmed attack would overstate the evidence.',preconditions:'Named human reviewer, explicit simulation acknowledgement, and a clear written decision.',criteria:'Review whether successful-session or identity/session evidence exists; record pass, fail or insufficient evidence separately.',status:'Pending Approval',evidence:[],simulationOnly:true,createdAt:new Date().toISOString()};await api('remediations',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify(plan)});state.data.remediations=[...(state.data.remediations||[]),plan]}await refresh();d.eventReady=!!byId('events',eventId);state.selected=correlationId;demoNavigate(2);if(d.eventReady)setTimeout(()=>detail('events',eventId),0)}catch(e){modal(`<h2>Could not create demo records</h2><p class="alert">${esc(e.message)}</p><p>Existing deterministic IDs will be reused on retry.</p><div class="modal-actions"><button class="btn" onclick="closeModal()">Close</button><button class="btn primary" onclick="createGuidedDemoRecords()">Retry missing demo records</button></div>`)}}function startNetworkBackdrop(){
  const canvas=$('#network-backdrop'),ctx=canvas?.getContext('2d',{alpha:true});if(!canvas||!ctx)return;
  const reduced=window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)');let width=0,height=0,dpr=1,nodes=[],frame=0,last=0,clock=0;
  function resize(){width=window.innerWidth;height=window.innerHeight;dpr=Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio||1,1.5);canvas.width=Math.floor(width*dpr);canvas.height=Math.floor(height*dpr);canvas.style.width=`${width}px`;canvas.style.height=`${height}px`;ctx.setTransform(dpr,0,0,dpr,0,0);let count=width<700?18:Math.min(46,Math.max(24,Math.round(width/34)));nodes=Array.from({length:count},()=>({x:Math.random()*width,y:Math.random()*height,vx:(Math.random()-.5)*.13,vy:(Math.random()-.5)*.13,r:Math.random()*1.4+.7,phase:Math.random()}));draw(0)}
  function draw(time){ctx.clearRect(0,0,width,height);const reach=width<700?118:164,step=time*.00011;for(let i=0;i<nodes.length;i++){let a=nodes[i];if(!reduced.matches){a.x+=a.vx;a.y+=a.vy;if(a.x<0||a.x>width)a.vx*=-1;if(a.y<0||a.y>height)a.vy*=-1}for(let j=i+1;j<nodes.length;j++){let b=nodes[j],dx=b.x-a.x,dy=b.y-a.y,d=Math.hypot(dx,dy);if(d<reach){let alpha=(1-d/reach)*.13;ctx.strokeStyle=(i+j)%4===0?`rgba(142,166,137,${alpha})`:`rgba(120,184,221,${alpha*.55})`;ctx.lineWidth=.7;ctx.beginPath();ctx.moveTo(a.x,a.y);ctx.lineTo(b.x,b.y);ctx.stroke();if((i*nodes.length+j)%13===0){let t=(a.phase+step*.32)%1;ctx.fillStyle='rgba(120,184,221,.22)';ctx.beginPath();ctx.arc(a.x+dx*t,a.y+dy*t,1.25,0,Math.PI*2);ctx.fill()}}}ctx.fillStyle='rgba(120,184,221,.20)';ctx.beginPath();ctx.arc(a.x,a.y,a.r,0,Math.PI*2);ctx.fill();ctx.fillStyle='rgba(142,166,137,.07)';ctx.beginPath();ctx.arc(a.x,a.y,a.r*3.2,0,Math.PI*2);ctx.fill()}}
  function animate(now){frame=requestAnimationFrame(animate);if(now-last<33)return;last=now;clock=now;draw(clock)}
  function motionChanged(){if(frame)cancelAnimationFrame(frame);frame=0;if(reduced.matches)draw(0);else frame=requestAnimationFrame(animate)}
  resize();window.addEventListener('resize',resize,{passive:true});reduced.addEventListener?.('change',motionChanged);if(!reduced.matches)frame=requestAnimationFrame(animate)
}

const DEMO_ADMIN_CSRF_KEY='cr-live-demo-csrf';
const ACCESS_CSRF_KEY='cr-workspace-csrf',ACCESS_REQUEST_KEY='cr-workspace-access-request';
let liveDemoPoll=null,phoneDemoPoll=null;
const demoSessionId=()=>new URLSearchParams(location.search).get('session')||'';
function demoAdminHeaders(){return {'Content-Type':'application/json','X-CSRF-Token':state.demoAdmin?.csrfToken||sessionStorage.getItem(DEMO_ADMIN_CSRF_KEY)||''}}
async function demoAdminApi(path,opts={}){const headers={...demoAdminHeaders(),...(opts.headers||{})};const r=await fetch(`${API_BASE}/api/demo/admin/${path}`,{credentials:'include',...opts,headers});const data=await r.json().catch(()=>({error:'Invalid server response'}));if(!r.ok)throw Error(data.error||`Request failed (${r.status})`);return data}
async function demoPublicApi(path,opts={}){const r=await fetch(`${API_BASE}/api/demo/${path}`,{...opts,headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json',...(opts.headers||{})}});const data=await r.json().catch(()=>({error:'Invalid server response'}));if(!r.ok)throw Error(data.error||`Request failed (${r.status})`);return data}
async function workspaceAccessApi(path,opts={}){const r=await fetch(`${API_BASE}/api/access/${path}`,{credentials:'include',...opts,headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json','X-CSRF-Token':state.accessSession?.csrfToken||sessionStorage.getItem(ACCESS_CSRF_KEY)||'',...(opts.headers||{})}});const data=await r.json().catch(()=>({error:'Invalid server response'}));if(!r.ok){const error=Error(data.error||`Request failed (${r.status})`);error.data=data;throw error}return data}
async function workspaceAccessAdminApi(path,opts={}){const r=await fetch(`${API_BASE}/api/access/admin/${path}`,{credentials:'include',...opts,headers:{...demoAdminHeaders(),...(opts.headers||{})}});const data=await r.json().catch(()=>({error:'Invalid server response'}));if(!r.ok)throw Error(data.error||`Request failed (${r.status})`);return data}
function workspaceAccessPanel(){if(state.accessSession?.role!=='owner')return '';const requests=state.accessRequests||[],securityEvents=state.accessSecurityEvents||[];return `<section class="live-demo-card workspace-access-admin" aria-labelledby="workspace-access-heading"><div class="live-demo-heading"><span class="eyebrow">WORKSPACE ACCESS · OWNER APPROVAL</span><h2 id="workspace-access-heading">Asset-management requests</h2><p>Review each named request before granting the scoped asset-management permission. Approval alone does not create a login session; the requester must return and establish it.</p></div><div class="workspace-access-tools">${state.accessQr?`<img class="workspace-access-qr" alt="QR link to request asset-management access" src="${state.accessQr.image}"><span class="workspace-access-expiry">Request link expires ${esc(new Date(state.accessQr.expires_at).toLocaleString())}</span><button class="text-action" onclick="copyWorkspaceAccessLink()">Copy request link</button>`:`<button class="btn small primary" onclick="createWorkspaceAccessQr()">Create request QR link</button>`}<button class="text-action" onclick="pollWorkspaceAccess()">Refresh requests</button></div>${state.accessMessage?`<p class="access-admin-feedback" role="status">${esc(state.accessMessage)}</p>`:''}${securityEvents.length?`<section class="access-security-alerts" aria-label="Security alerts"><h3>Failed passphrase attempts</h3>${securityEvents.map(e=>`<article class="access-security-alert"><b>${esc(e.failedCount)} consecutive failed attempts</b><small>${esc(new Date(e.timestamp).toLocaleString())} · Source IP: ${esc(e.sourceIp)}</small><small>Email notification: ${esc(e.emailStatus)}${e.emailSentAt?` · accepted ${esc(new Date(e.emailSentAt).toLocaleString())}`:''}${e.emailError?` · ${esc(e.emailError)}`:''}</small></article>`).join('')}</section>`:''}${requests.length?`<div class="demo-request-list">${requests.map(r=>`<article class="demo-request ${String(r.status).toLowerCase()} ${r.revoked_at?'revoked':''}"><div class="demo-request-top"><b>${esc(r.display_name)}</b>${status(r.revoked_at?'REVOKED':r.status)}</div><small>${esc(r.id)} · ${esc(new Date(r.created_at).toLocaleString())} · Scope: ${esc(r.permission_scope)}</small><small>Identity ${esc(r.identity_id)}${r.decided_by?` · Decision by ${esc(r.decided_by)}`:''}</small><div class="demo-request-actions">${r.status==='PENDING'?`<button class="btn small primary" onclick="decideWorkspaceAccess('${esc(r.id)}','APPROVED')">Approve</button><button class="btn small danger" onclick="decideWorkspaceAccess('${esc(r.id)}','DECLINED')">Decline</button>`:r.status==='APPROVED'&&!r.revoked_at?`<span>Approval recorded · awaiting requester entry or active session</span><button class="btn small danger-outline" onclick="revokeWorkspaceAccess('${esc(r.id)}')">Revoke access</button>`:`<span>${r.revoked_at?'Access revoked':esc(r.status)}</span>`}</div></article>`).join('')}</div>`:'<div class="demo-request-empty">No access requests yet. Requests from this page and the QR link appear here automatically.</div>'}</section>`}
function renderAccessPortal(){const app=$('#app');if(!app)return;const request=state.accessRequest,context=new URLSearchParams(location.search).get('context')||'',config=state.accessConfig;app.innerHTML=`<main class="demo-phone-page access-portal"><section class="demo-phone-card"><div class="demo-phone-brand"><span class="demo-phone-logo">C</span><span><b>CyberRakshak AI</b><small>Workspace access</small></span></div><span class="eyebrow">SECURE WORKSPACE ENTRY</span><h1>Login / Request Access</h1><p class="demo-phone-intro">Request asset-management access from the workspace owner. Your browser receives a private proof key; the display name is for the owner’s review and is not used as your identity.</p>${state.accessMessage?`<div class="alert error-alert" role="alert">${esc(state.accessMessage)}</div>`:''}${request?`<div class="demo-phone-result ${String(request.status).toLowerCase()}"><span class="demo-result-icon">${request.status==='APPROVED'?'✓':request.status==='PENDING'?'…':request.status==='DECLINED'?'×':'!'}</span><div><b>${request.status==='APPROVED'?'Access approved':request.status==='DECLINED'?'Request declined':request.status==='EXPIRED'?'Request expired':request.revoked_at?'Access revoked':'Waiting for owner approval'}</b><small>${request.status==='PENDING'?'Keep this page open while the owner reviews your request.':request.status==='APPROVED'&&!request.revoked_at?'The owner approved asset-management access. Continue to establish your protected session.':request.status==='DECLINED'?'No workspace access was granted.':request.revoked_at?'The workspace owner revoked this access.':'This request is no longer active. Submit a new request.'}</small></div></div><dl class="demo-request-meta"><div><dt>Request</dt><dd>${esc(request.id)}</dd></div><div><dt>Identity</dt><dd>${esc(request.identity_id)}</dd></div><div><dt>Permission scope</dt><dd>${esc(request.permission_scope)}</dd></div><div><dt>Status</dt><dd>${esc(request.revoked_at?'REVOKED':request.status)}</dd></div><div><dt>Requested</dt><dd>${esc(new Date(request.created_at).toLocaleString())}</dd></div></dl>${request.status==='APPROVED'&&!request.revoked_at?`<button class="btn primary" onclick="establishWorkspaceAccess()">Continue to CyberRakshak</button>`:`<button class="btn" onclick="resetWorkspaceAccessRequest()">Request access again</button>`}`:`<form onsubmit="return submitWorkspaceAccessRequest(event)"><label class="field"><span>Display name for owner review</span><input id="workspace-access-name" name="display_name" maxlength="48" minlength="2" autocomplete="name" required placeholder="e.g. Alex Morgan"></label><p class="demo-disclaimer">Requested scope: <b>Asset management</b>. This browser-generated identity is device-bound, not verified as a real-world person. Do not enter passwords, one-time codes, or sensitive information.</p><p id="workspace-access-error" class="demo-form-error" role="alert"></p><button class="btn primary demo-request-access" type="submit" ${config?.enabled===false?'disabled':''}>Request asset-management access</button></form>`}<div class="demo-phone-foot"><span class="sim-dot"></span>Owner approval required · scoped backend session${context?' · QR request context linked':''}</div><div class="access-owner-entry"><button class="text-action" onclick="openOwnerAccessLogin()">Workspace owner sign in</button></div></section></main>`}
async function initializeAccessPortal(){renderAccessPortal();try{state.accessConfig=await workspaceAccessApi('config');const saved=JSON.parse(sessionStorage.getItem(ACCESS_REQUEST_KEY)||'null');if(saved?.requestId&&saved?.requestKey){state.accessRequest=await workspaceAccessApi(`requests/${encodeURIComponent(saved.requestId)}`,{headers:{'X-Request-Proof':saved.requestKey}});renderAccessPortal();if(state.accessRequest.status==='PENDING')beginWorkspaceRequestPolling(saved.requestId,saved.requestKey)}}catch(e){state.accessMessage=e.message;renderAccessPortal()}}
function newWorkspaceProofKey(){if(crypto.randomUUID)return crypto.randomUUID();if(!crypto.getRandomValues)throw Error('This browser cannot create a secure access proof. Update the browser and try again.');const bytes=new Uint8Array(16);crypto.getRandomValues(bytes);return Array.from(bytes,b=>b.toString(16).padStart(2,'0')).join('')}
async function submitWorkspaceAccessRequest(event){event.preventDefault();const input=$('#workspace-access-name'),name=(input?.value||'').trim(),error=$('#workspace-access-error');try{let saved=JSON.parse(sessionStorage.getItem(ACCESS_REQUEST_KEY)||'null');if(saved?.requestId&&saved?.status!=='DECLINED'&&saved?.status!=='EXPIRED')throw Error('A request is already saved in this browser. Check its status or request again after it closes.');const requestKey=saved?.requestKey||newWorkspaceProofKey(),contextId=new URLSearchParams(location.search).get('context')||'';const result=await workspaceAccessApi('requests',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify({display_name:name,request_key:requestKey,context_id:contextId})});state.accessRequest=result;sessionStorage.setItem(ACCESS_REQUEST_KEY,JSON.stringify({requestId:result.id,requestKey,status:result.status}));state.accessMessage='';renderAccessPortal();if(result.status==='PENDING')beginWorkspaceRequestPolling(result.id,requestKey)}catch(e){if(error)error.textContent=e.message}return false}
function renderSecureAccessPortal(){
  const app=$('#app');if(!app)return;
  const ready=state.accessConfig?.enabled!==false;
  app.innerHTML=`<main class="demo-phone-page access-portal"><section class="demo-phone-card"><div class="demo-phone-brand"><span class="demo-phone-logo">C</span><span><b>CyberRakshak AI</b><small>Secure workspace entry</small></span></div><span class="eyebrow">PROTECTED WORKSPACE</span><h1>Secure Access</h1><p class="demo-phone-intro">Enter your access passphrase to continue.</p>${state.accessMessage?`<div class="alert error-alert" role="alert">${esc(state.accessMessage)}</div>`:''}${!ready?'<div class="alert error-alert" role="alert">Workspace access is not configured. Contact the workspace owner.</div>':''}<form class="access-passphrase-form" onsubmit="return verifyWorkspacePassphrase(event)"><label class="field"><span>Passphrase</span><input id="workspace-access-passphrase" name="passphrase" type="password" autocomplete="current-password" required ${!ready?'disabled':''}></label><button class="btn primary" type="submit" ${!ready?'disabled':''}>Continue</button></form><div class="demo-phone-foot"><span class="sim-dot"></span>Backend verified · protected session required</div><div class="access-owner-entry"><button class="text-action" onclick="openOwnerAccessLogin()">Workspace owner sign in</button></div></section></main>`;
}
renderAccessPortal=renderSecureAccessPortal;
async function verifyWorkspacePassphrase(event){event.preventDefault();const input=$('#workspace-access-passphrase'),passphrase=input?.value||'';try{const result=await workspaceAccessApi('passphrase',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify({passphrase})});if(input)input.value='';if(result.csrfToken)sessionStorage.setItem(ACCESS_CSRF_KEY,result.csrfToken);state.accessSession=await workspaceAccessApi('session');state.accessPortalActive=false;state.accessMessage='';if(location.pathname.replace(/\/$/,'')==='/access-request'){const local=new URLSearchParams(location.search).get('api')==='local';history.replaceState(null,'',`/${local?'?api=local':''}`)}await refresh();if(state.accessSession.role==='owner'){await restoreDemoAdmin();await pollWorkspaceAccess(false);beginWorkspaceAccessPolling()}}catch(e){const data=e.data||{};state.accessSession=null;state.accessMessage=data.failedAttempts?`${e.message} (${data.failedAttempts} consecutive ${data.failedAttempts===1?'failure':'failures'}).`:e.message;if(data.retryAt)state.accessMessage+=` Try again after ${new Date(data.retryAt).toLocaleTimeString()}.`;renderAccessPortal();$('#workspace-access-passphrase')?.focus()}return false}
function showWorkspaceRequestForm(){return false}
function toggleWorkspacePassphraseVisibility(){return false}
async function initializeSecureAccessPortal(){renderAccessPortal();try{state.accessConfig=await workspaceAccessApi('config')}catch(e){state.accessMessage=e.message;renderAccessPortal()}}
initializeAccessPortal=initializeSecureAccessPortal;
function openOwnerAccessLogin(){state.accessPortalActive=true;showDemoAdminLogin()}
async function pollWorkspaceAccess(renderAfter=true){if(state.accessSession?.role!=='owner')return;try{const [data,alerts]=await Promise.all([workspaceAccessAdminApi('requests'),workspaceAccessAdminApi('security-events')]);state.accessRequests=data.requests||[];state.accessSecurityEvents=alerts.events||[];if(renderAfter&&!$('.modal'))render()}catch(e){if(e.message.includes('401')){state.accessSession=null;state.demoAdmin=null;state.accessMessage='Owner session expired. Sign in again to manage workspace requests.';renderAccessPortal()}}}
function beginWorkspaceAccessPolling(){clearInterval(workspaceAccessPoll);if(state.accessSession?.role==='owner')workspaceAccessPoll=setInterval(()=>pollWorkspaceAccess(),3000)}
async function decideWorkspaceAccess(id,decision){try{const result=await workspaceAccessAdminApi(`requests/${encodeURIComponent(id)}/decision`,{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify({decision})});state.accessMessage=`${result.display_name} access request ${result.status.toLowerCase()}.`;await pollWorkspaceAccess();}catch(e){state.accessMessage=`Decision was not recorded: ${e.message}`;render()}}
async function revokeWorkspaceAccess(id){try{const result=await workspaceAccessAdminApi(`requests/${encodeURIComponent(id)}/revoke`,{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify({})});state.accessMessage=`Asset-management access for ${result.display_name} was revoked.`;await pollWorkspaceAccess()}catch(e){state.accessMessage=`Access was not revoked: ${e.message}`;render()}}
async function createWorkspaceAccessQr(){try{const context=await workspaceAccessAdminApi('contexts',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify({})}),qr=await workspaceAccessAdminApi(`qr?contextId=${encodeURIComponent(context.id)}`);state.accessQr={...qr,id:context.id,image:`data:image/svg+xml;base64,${btoa(unescape(encodeURIComponent(qr.svg)))}`};state.accessMessage='A time-limited, owner-approved access request QR link is ready.';render()}catch(e){state.accessMessage=`Could not create access QR link: ${e.message}`;render()}}
async function copyWorkspaceAccessLink(){try{if(!state.accessQr?.url)throw Error('Create an access QR link first.');await navigator.clipboard.writeText(state.accessQr.url);state.accessMessage='Workspace access request link copied.';render()}catch(e){state.accessMessage=e.message;render()}}
async function logoutWorkspaceAccess(){try{await workspaceAccessApi('logout',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify({})})}catch{}state.accessSession=null;sessionStorage.removeItem(ACCESS_CSRF_KEY);clearInterval(workspaceAccessPoll);renderAccessPortal()}
function liveDemoPanel(){
 const d=state.liveDemo;
 if(!d)return `<section class="live-demo-card"><div><span class="eyebrow">TWO-DEVICE PRESENTATION</span><h2>Live access approval demo</h2><p>Start a time-limited session, let a participant request access from their phone, then record your decision.</p>${state.demoConfig?.publicBaseConfigured===false?'<small class="demo-setup-hint">Set DEMO_PUBLIC_BASE_URL on the API host before creating a QR code.</small>':''}</div><div class="live-demo-actions">${state.demoAdmin?'<button class="btn primary" onclick="startLiveDemo()">Start Live Demo</button>':'<button class="btn primary" onclick="showDemoAdminLogin()">Administrator sign in</button>'}</div></section>`;
 return `<section class="live-demo-card active" aria-labelledby="live-demo-heading"><div class="live-demo-heading"><span class="eyebrow">LIVE SESSION · SIMULATED ONLY</span><h2 id="live-demo-heading">Phone approval requests</h2><p>${d.status==='ACTIVE'?`Session expires ${esc(new Date(d.expires_at).toLocaleString())}.`:'This demo session has expired; pending requests are closed.'} No real account or infrastructure access is changed.</p></div><div class="live-demo-content"><div class="live-demo-qr">${d.qr?`<img alt="QR code for the CyberRakshak fictional access request page" src="${d.qr}">`:d.qrError?`<div class="demo-qr-error">${esc(d.qrError)}</div>`:'<div class="demo-qr-loading">Preparing private session QR…</div>'}<button class="text-action" onclick="copyDemoLink()">Copy phone link</button></div><div class="live-demo-requests"><div class="demo-instructions"><b>For the participant</b><span>Scan the QR code, enter a fictional display name and tap Request Access. No password or OTP is requested.</span></div><div class="demo-request-summary"><b>${(d.requests||[]).filter(x=>x.status==='PENDING').length}</b><span>pending request${(d.requests||[]).filter(x=>x.status==='PENDING').length===1?'':'s'}</span><button class="text-action" onclick="pollLiveDemo()">Refresh requests</button></div>${(d.requests||[]).length?`<div class="demo-request-list">${d.requests.map(r=>`<article class="demo-request ${String(r.status).toLowerCase()}"><div class="demo-request-top"><b>${esc(r.display_name)}</b>${status(r.status)}</div><small>${esc(r.id)} · ${esc(new Date(r.created_at).toLocaleTimeString())}</small><div class="demo-request-actions">${r.status==='PENDING'?`<button class="btn small primary" onclick="decideLiveRequest('${esc(r.id)}','APPROVED')">Approve</button><button class="btn small danger" onclick="decideLiveRequest('${esc(r.id)}','DECLINED')">Decline</button>`:`<button class="text-action" onclick="openDemoEvent('${esc(r.event_id)}')">View synthetic event ↗</button><span>${esc(r.status)}</span>`}</div></article>`).join('')}</div>`:'<div class="demo-request-empty">Waiting for the first phone request…</div>'}</div></div><div class="live-demo-footer"><span>Decisions are persisted and audited. Approval is only a presentation result.</span><div class="live-demo-footer-actions">${d.status!=='ACTIVE'?'<button class="btn small primary" onclick="startLiveDemo()">Start new session</button>':''}<button class="btn small" onclick="demoAdminLogout()">Sign out</button><button class="btn small danger-outline" onclick="confirmDemoReset()">${d.status==='ACTIVE'?'End & reset session':'Reset this demo session'}</button></div></div></section>`
}
function showDemoAdminLogin(){modal(`<h2>Presenter sign in</h2><p>Use the demo administrator passphrase configured on the backend. It is sent only to the configured API over the current origin.</p><form onsubmit="return demoAdminLogin(event)"><label class="field"><span>Administrator passphrase</span><input id="demo-admin-password" type="password" autocomplete="current-password" minlength="20" required></label><p id="demo-admin-error" class="demo-form-error" role="alert"></p><div class="modal-actions"><button type="button" class="btn" onclick="closeModal()">Cancel</button><button class="btn primary" type="submit">Sign in</button></div></form>`);setTimeout(()=>$('#demo-admin-password')?.focus(),0)}
async function demoAdminLogin(event){event.preventDefault();const input=$('#demo-admin-password'),password=input?.value||'';try{const r=await fetch(`${API_BASE}/api/demo/admin/login`,{method:'POST',credentials:'include',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'},body:JSON.stringify({password})});const data=await r.json().catch(()=>({error:'Invalid server response'}));if(!r.ok)throw Error(data.error||`Sign in failed (${r.status})`);state.demoAdmin={adminName:data.adminName,csrfToken:data.csrfToken,expiresAt:data.expiresAt};state.accessSession={role:'owner',admin_name:data.adminName,displayName:data.adminName,permissionScope:'*',csrfToken:data.csrfToken,expiresAt:data.expiresAt};sessionStorage.setItem(DEMO_ADMIN_CSRF_KEY,data.csrfToken);sessionStorage.setItem(ACCESS_CSRF_KEY,data.csrfToken);if(input)input.value='';closeModal();state.accessPortalActive=false;await refresh();await restoreDemoAdmin();await pollWorkspaceAccess(false);beginWorkspaceAccessPolling()}catch(e){const out=$('#demo-admin-error');if(out)out.textContent=e.message}return false}
async function restoreDemoAdmin(){try{const csrf=sessionStorage.getItem(DEMO_ADMIN_CSRF_KEY);if(!csrf)return;state.demoAdmin={csrfToken:csrf};const data=await demoAdminApi('session');state.demoAdmin={...state.demoAdmin,adminName:data.adminName,expiresAt:data.expiresAt};if(data.session){state.liveDemo={...data.session,requests:[]};if(state.liveDemo.status==='ACTIVE')await loadDemoQr();else state.liveDemo.qrError='This session expired. Start a new session for another request.';await pollLiveDemo(false)}render()}catch(e){state.demoAdmin=null;state.liveDemo=null;sessionStorage.removeItem(DEMO_ADMIN_CSRF_KEY)}}
async function loadDemoQr(){if(!state.liveDemo)return;if(state.liveDemo.status!=='ACTIVE'){state.liveDemo.qrError='This session is no longer active.';return}try{const data=await demoAdminApi(`qr?sessionId=${encodeURIComponent(state.liveDemo.id)}`);state.liveDemo.loginUrl=data.url;state.liveDemo.qr=`data:image/svg+xml;base64,${btoa(unescape(encodeURIComponent(data.svg)))}`}catch(e){state.liveDemo.qrError=e.message} }
async function startLiveDemo(){if(!state.demoAdmin)return showDemoAdminLogin();try{if(state.demoConfig?.publicBaseConfigured===false)throw Error('The API host has no valid DEMO_PUBLIC_BASE_URL. Configure a reachable HTTPS address or private Wi-Fi IP, then restart the API.');const data=await demoAdminApi('sessions',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify({})});state.liveDemo={...data,requests:[]};await loadDemoQr();await pollLiveDemo(false);render();beginLiveDemoPolling();if(state.liveDemo.qrError)modal(`<h2>QR code unavailable</h2><p>${esc(state.liveDemo.qrError)}</p><button class="btn" onclick="closeModal()">Close</button>`)}catch(e){modal(`<h2>Could not start live demo</h2><p>${esc(e.message)}</p><button class="btn" onclick="closeModal()">Close</button>`)}}
async function pollLiveDemo(renderAfter=true){if(!state.liveDemo||!state.demoAdmin)return;try{const data=await demoAdminApi(`requests?sessionId=${encodeURIComponent(state.liveDemo.id)}`);state.liveDemo.requests=data.requests||[];state.liveDemo.status=data.sessionStatus||state.liveDemo.status;if(state.liveDemo.status!=='ACTIVE'){state.liveDemo.qr=null;state.liveDemo.qrError='This session expired. Start a new session or reset its synthetic records.';clearInterval(liveDemoPoll)}if(renderAfter&&!$('.modal'))render()}catch(e){if(e.message.includes('401')){state.demoAdmin=null;state.liveDemo=null;sessionStorage.removeItem(DEMO_ADMIN_CSRF_KEY);render()}else if(e.message.includes('410')){state.liveDemo.status='EXPIRED';state.liveDemo.qr=null;state.liveDemo.qrError='This session has expired. Start a new session or reset its synthetic records.';state.liveDemo.requests=(state.liveDemo.requests||[]).map(r=>r.status==='PENDING'?{...r,status:'EXPIRED'}:r);clearInterval(liveDemoPoll);render()}}}
function beginLiveDemoPolling(){clearInterval(liveDemoPoll);if(state.liveDemo?.status==='ACTIVE')liveDemoPoll=setInterval(()=>pollLiveDemo(),2500)}
async function decideLiveRequest(id,decision){try{await demoAdminApi(`requests/${encodeURIComponent(id)}/decision`,{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify({decision})});await pollLiveDemo();}catch(e){modal(`<h2>Decision was not recorded</h2><p>${esc(e.message)}</p><button class="btn" onclick="closeModal()">Close</button>`);await pollLiveDemo()}}
async function copyDemoLink(){try{if(!state.liveDemo?.loginUrl)await loadDemoQr();if(!state.liveDemo?.loginUrl)throw Error(state.liveDemo?.qrError||'Phone link is unavailable.');await navigator.clipboard.writeText(state.liveDemo.loginUrl);modal(`<h2>Phone link copied</h2><p>Share this link only with participants on the intended demo network.</p><button class="btn" onclick="closeModal()">Done</button>`)}catch(e){modal(`<h2>Could not copy phone link</h2><p>${esc(e.message)}</p><button class="btn" onclick="closeModal()">Close</button>`)}}
async function demoAdminLogout(){try{if(state.demoAdmin)await demoAdminApi('logout',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify({})})}catch{}clearInterval(liveDemoPoll);clearInterval(workspaceAccessPoll);state.demoAdmin=null;state.accessSession=null;state.liveDemo=null;state.accessRequests=[];sessionStorage.removeItem(DEMO_ADMIN_CSRF_KEY);sessionStorage.removeItem(ACCESS_CSRF_KEY);closeModal();renderAccessPortal()}
function confirmDemoReset(){modal(`<h2>End and reset this live session?</h2><p>This closes the current session and removes only its synthetic request records and synthetic events. Audit entries and all other workspace records are retained.</p><div class="modal-actions"><button class="btn" onclick="closeModal()">Keep session</button><button class="btn danger" onclick="resetLiveDemo()">End and reset</button></div>`)}
async function resetLiveDemo(){if(!state.liveDemo)return;try{await demoAdminApi(`sessions/${encodeURIComponent(state.liveDemo.id)}/reset`,{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify({})});clearInterval(liveDemoPoll);state.liveDemo=null;closeModal();await refresh()}catch(e){modal(`<h2>Session was not reset</h2><p>${esc(e.message)}</p><button class="btn" onclick="closeModal()">Close</button>` )}}
async function openDemoEvent(eventId){try{await refresh();state.page='Events';render();detail('events',eventId)}catch(e){modal(`<h2>Could not load event</h2><p>${esc(e.message)}</p><button class="btn" onclick="closeModal()">Close</button>`)}}
function renderDemoLogin(){const app=$('#app');if(!app)return;const id=demoSessionId();const d=state.demoLogin;app.innerHTML=`<main class="demo-phone-page"><section class="demo-phone-card"><div class="demo-phone-brand"><span class="demo-phone-logo">C</span><span><b>CyberRakshak AI</b><small>Secure access demonstration</small></span></div><span class="eyebrow">NORTHSTAR DENTAL CLINIC · PRESENTATION MODE</span><h1>Request workspace access</h1><p class="demo-phone-intro">Submit a fictional access request. The presenter will review it in the CyberRakshak dashboard.</p>${!id?'<div class="alert error-alert">This request link is incomplete. Ask the presenter to display the current session QR code.</div>':d?.status?`<div class="demo-phone-result ${String(d.status).toLowerCase()}"><span class="demo-result-icon">${d.status==='APPROVED'?'✓':d.status==='PENDING'?'…':d.status==='DECLINED'?'×':'!'}</span><div><b>${d.status==='APPROVED'?'Request approved':d.status==='DECLINED'?'Request declined':d.status==='EXPIRED'?'Request expired':'Waiting for presenter'}</b><small>${d.status==='PENDING'?'Keep this page open while the presenter reviews the request.':d.status==='APPROVED'?'The backend confirmed the presentation decision. No real account was granted access.':d.status==='DECLINED'?'The backend confirmed the presentation decision.': 'Start a new request with the presenter’s current QR code.'}</small></div></div><dl class="demo-request-meta"><div><dt>Request ID</dt><dd>${esc(d.id)}</dd></div><div><dt>Current status</dt><dd>${esc(d.status)}</dd></div>${d.created_at?`<div><dt>Submitted</dt><dd>${esc(new Date(d.created_at).toLocaleString())}</dd></div>`:''}</dl>${d.status!=='PENDING'?'<button class="btn" onclick="resetPhoneDemo()">Request again</button>':''}${d.error?`<p class="demo-form-error" role="alert">${esc(d.error)}</p>`:''}`:`<form onsubmit="return submitPhoneDemo(event)"><label class="field"><span>Fictional display name</span><input id="demo-display-name" name="display_name" maxlength="48" minlength="2" autocomplete="nickname" required placeholder="e.g. Alex Morgan"></label><p class="demo-disclaimer">Simulation only. Do not enter a password, one-time code, real account details or sensitive personal information.</p><p class="demo-form-error" id="phone-demo-error" role="alert"></p><button class="btn primary demo-request-access" type="submit" ${!id?'disabled':''}>Request Access</button></form>`}<div class="demo-phone-foot"><span class="sim-dot"></span>Fictional presentation workflow · no real login</div></section></main>`}
async function initializeDemoLogin(){clearInterval(phoneDemoPoll);const id=demoSessionId(),key=`cr-demo-request:${id}`;state.demoLogin=null;renderDemoLogin();if(!id)return;try{const saved=JSON.parse(sessionStorage.getItem(key)||'null');if(saved?.requestId){state.demoLogin=await demoPublicApi(`requests/${encodeURIComponent(saved.requestId)}`);renderDemoLogin();if(state.demoLogin.status==='PENDING')beginPhonePolling(saved.requestId,key)}}catch(e){sessionStorage.removeItem(key)}}
function newDemoUuid(){if(crypto.randomUUID)return crypto.randomUUID();return 'xxxxxxxx-xxxx-4xxx-yxxx-xxxxxxxxxxxx'.replace(/[xy]/g,c=>{const r=Math.random()*16|0;return(c==='x'?r:(r&3|8)).toString(16)})}
async function submitPhoneDemo(event){event.preventDefault();const input=$('#demo-display-name'),name=(input?.value||'').trim(),sessionId=demoSessionId(),key=`cr-demo-request:${sessionId}`,existing=JSON.parse(sessionStorage.getItem(key)||'null'),retryKey=existing?.retryKey||newDemoUuid();const error=$('#phone-demo-error');if(!name){if(error)error.textContent='Enter a fictional display name.';return false}try{const result=await demoPublicApi('requests',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify({session_id:sessionId,display_name:name,idempotency_key:retryKey})});state.demoLogin=result;sessionStorage.setItem(key,JSON.stringify({retryKey,requestId:result.id}));renderDemoLogin();if(result.status==='PENDING')beginPhonePolling(result.id,key)}catch(e){if(error)error.textContent=e.message}return false}
function beginPhonePolling(requestId,key){clearInterval(phoneDemoPoll);phoneDemoPoll=setInterval(async()=>{try{const result=await demoPublicApi(`requests/${encodeURIComponent(requestId)}`);state.demoLogin=result;renderDemoLogin();if(result.status!=='PENDING')clearInterval(phoneDemoPoll)}catch(e){const target=$('.demo-phone-card');if(target){let n=target.querySelector('.demo-form-error');if(!n){n=document.createElement('p');n.className='demo-form-error';target.append(n)}n.textContent=`Status check paused: ${e.message}`}}},2000)}
function resetPhoneDemo(){clearInterval(phoneDemoPoll);const key=`cr-demo-request:${demoSessionId()}`;sessionStorage.removeItem(key);state.demoLogin=null;renderDemoLogin()}


let introTimers=[],introFocusReturn=null;
function dismissIntro(){const layer=document.querySelector('.cr-intro');if(!layer||layer.classList.contains('is-exiting'))return;introTimers.forEach(clearTimeout);introTimers=[];layer.classList.add('is-exiting');const app=$('#app');if(app)app.inert=false;const reduce=matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches,delay=reduce?0:720;setTimeout(()=>{layer.remove();if(introFocusReturn?.isConnected)introFocusReturn.focus();else{const title=document.querySelector('.page-head h1');if(title){title.tabIndex=-1;title.focus({preventScroll:true})}}},delay)}
function playIntro(force=false){if(location.pathname.replace(/\/$/,'')==='/demo-login')return;if(!force&&sessionStorage.getItem('cr-cinematic-intro-seen')==='1')return;document.querySelector('.cr-intro')?.remove();introTimers.forEach(clearTimeout);introTimers=[];introFocusReturn=document.activeElement;sessionStorage.setItem('cr-cinematic-intro-seen','1');const app=$('#app');if(app)app.inert=true;document.body.insertAdjacentHTML('beforeend',`<section class="cr-intro" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="cr-intro-title" aria-describedby="cr-intro-description"><div class="intro-grid" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="intro-ambient intro-ambient-a" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="intro-ambient intro-ambient-b" aria-hidden="true"></div><svg class="intro-network" viewBox="0 0 1440 900" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M-60 630 190 480 390 545 585 330 820 390 1030 195 1260 275 1500 110M40 165 250 285 430 165 585 330 745 180 1030 195 1160 480 1390 405M190 480 250 285 585 330 820 390 940 600 1160 480 1260 275 1450 740M390 545 610 735 940 600 1160 480 1330 690"/><circle cx="190" cy="480" r="3"/><circle cx="390" cy="545" r="3"/><circle cx="585" cy="330" r="4"/><circle cx="820" cy="390" r="3"/><circle cx="1030" cy="195" r="4"/><circle cx="1160" cy="480" r="3"/><circle cx="940" cy="600" r="3"/><circle class="intro-signal" r="5"><animateMotion dur="4.8s" repeatCount="indefinite" path="M190 480 390 545 585 330 820 390 1030 195 1260 275 1500 110"/></circle></svg><button class="intro-skip" type="button" aria-label="Skip introduction">Skip Intro <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button><div class="intro-content"><p class="intro-kicker">EVIDENCE-BASED CYBER RISK INTELLIGENCE</p><h1 id="cr-intro-title"><span>CYBERRAKSHAK</span> <i>AI</i></h1><p class="intro-brand-sub">A clearer view of the signals that shape risk.</p><div class="intro-phrases" aria-label="Product principles"><span>Connect the Signals.</span><span>Verify the Evidence.</span><span>Prioritize the Risk.</span></div><p class="intro-description" id="cr-intro-description">Security signals are only the beginning. CyberRakshak AI connects findings with evidence to help teams investigate risk and take controlled action.</p><button class="btn intro-enter" type="button" hidden>Enter CyberRakshak <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></button></div><div class="intro-footer"><span>CYBERRAKSHAK AI</span><span>SIMULATION WORKSPACE · FICTIONAL DATA</span></div></section>`);const layer=document.querySelector('.cr-intro'),skip=layer.querySelector('.intro-skip'),enter=layer.querySelector('.intro-enter'),reduce=matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;skip.addEventListener('click',dismissIntro);enter.addEventListener('click',dismissIntro);layer.addEventListener('keydown',e=>{if(e.key==='Escape'){e.preventDefault();dismissIntro();return}if(e.key==='Tab'){const buttons=[...layer.querySelectorAll('button:not([hidden])')].filter(x=>x.getClientRects().length),first=buttons[0],last=buttons.at(-1);if(e.shiftKey&&document.activeElement===first){e.preventDefault();last?.focus()}else if(!e.shiftKey&&document.activeElement===last){e.preventDefault();first?.focus()}}});skip.focus();if(reduce){layer.classList.add('reduced-motion');layer.querySelector('.intro-signal')?.setAttribute('display','none');enter.hidden=false;enter.classList.add('is-ready');introTimers.push(setTimeout(dismissIntro,2800))}else{introTimers.push(setTimeout(()=>{enter.hidden=false;enter.classList.add('is-ready')},8350));introTimers.push(setTimeout(dismissIntro,10800))}}
function replayIntro(){playIntro(true)}
async function initializeWorkspaceSession(){try{const session=await workspaceAccessApi('session');state.accessSession=session;sessionStorage.setItem(ACCESS_CSRF_KEY,session.csrfToken);if(session.role==='owner'){state.demoAdmin={adminName:session.displayName,csrfToken:session.csrfToken,expiresAt:session.expiresAt};sessionStorage.setItem(DEMO_ADMIN_CSRF_KEY,session.csrfToken)}await refresh();if(session.role==='owner'){await restoreDemoAdmin();await pollWorkspaceAccess(false);beginWorkspaceAccessPolling()}return}catch(e){state.accessSession=null;state.demoAdmin=null;sessionStorage.removeItem(ACCESS_CSRF_KEY);if(e.message.includes('401'))await initializeAccessPortal();else{state.accessMessage=e.message;renderAccessPortal()}}}
function initializeApplication(){const path=location.pathname.replace(/\/$/,'');if(path==='/demo-login'){initializeDemoLogin();return}startNetworkBackdrop();renderAccessPortal();playIntro();initializeWorkspaceSession()}

document.addEventListener('keydown',e=>{if(e.key==='Escape')closeModal();if((e.ctrlKey||e.metaKey)&&e.key.toLowerCase()==='k'){e.preventDefault();$('.search')?.focus()}if(e.key==='Tab'&&$('.modal')){let f=[...$('.modal').querySelectorAll('button,input,select,textarea,[tabindex]:not([tabindex="-1"])')].filter(x=>!x.disabled),first=f[0],last=f[f.length-1];if(e.shiftKey&&document.activeElement===first){e.preventDefault();last?.focus()}else if(!e.shiftKey&&document.activeElement===last){e.preventDefault();first?.focus()}}});
initializeApplication()
